(window.webpackJsonp=window.webpackJsonp||[]).push([[60],{1168:function(n){n.exports=JSON.parse('{"html":"<h1 id=\\"计算机基础\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#计算机基础\\">#</a> 计算机基础</h1>\\n<h2 id=\\"一、网络\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#一、网络\\">#</a> 一、网络</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>分层记：应用层（<code>HTTP</code> / <code>DNS</code> / <code>WebSocket</code>）→ 传输层（<code>TCP</code> / <code>UDP</code>）→ 网络层（<code>IP</code>）→ 链路层</li>\\n<li><code>TCP</code> 用握手、确认、重传换可靠有序，<code>UDP</code> 全不管换低延迟；<code>HTTP/3</code> 的 <code>QUIC</code> 在 <code>UDP</code> 上自己做了可靠传输</li>\\n<li>前端最该抓三段：<code>DNS</code> 解析、建连成本（<code>TCP</code> + <code>TLS</code> 握手往返）、缓存策略（强缓存 / 协商缓存）</li>\\n<li>队头阻塞：<code>HTTP/1.1</code> 一个连接同时只跑一个请求 → <code>HTTP/2</code> 多路复用解决应用层，但丢包时 <code>TCP</code> 层还会卡 → <code>HTTP/3</code> 换 <code>QUIC</code> 解决</li>\\n<li>排查按层缩小：打不开先看 <code>DNS</code> 和连通性，证书报错是 <code>TLS</code>，有响应但内容不对才是应用层</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>前端学网络，最实用的是能把一次请求按层拆开：先 <code>DNS</code> 拿 <code>IP</code>，再 <code>TCP</code> 建连，<code>HTTPS</code> 还要 <code>TLS</code> 握手，最后才是 <code>HTTP</code> 请求和响应。</strong> 每一段都有成本，<code>DNS</code> 有缓存，握手要来回跑几趟，所以才有 <code>preconnect</code>、复用连接、收敛域名这些优化；资源能不能干脆不发请求，就看缓存策略。出问题时也按这个顺序查：解析不对、连不上、证书错、还是接口本身返回不对，先定位到层再动手，别一上来就怀疑业务代码。</p>\\n</section>\\n<div class=\\"vp-seq\\"><div class=\\"vp-seq__bar\\"><span class=\\"vp-seq__hint\\">时序图 · 3 个参与者 / 11 步</span></div><div class=\\"vp-seq__canvas\\"><svg xmlns=\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\" class=\\"vp-seq-svg\\" width=\\"499\\" height=\\"776\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 499 776\\" font-family=\'-apple-system, \\"PingFang SC\\", \\"Microsoft YaHei\\", \\"Helvetica Neue\\", Arial, sans-serif\' role=\\"img\\" aria-label=\\"时序图\\"><rect x=\\"0\\" y=\\"0\\" width=\\"499\\" height=\\"776\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" class=\\"sq-f-bg\\"/><line x1=\\"56\\" y1=\\"46\\" x2=\\"56\\" y2=\\"728\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-s-lifeline\\" stroke-width=\\"1\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"4 4\\"/><line x1=\\"284.5\\" y1=\\"46\\" x2=\\"284.5\\" y2=\\"728\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-s-lifeline\\" stroke-width=\\"1\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"4 4\\"/><line x1=\\"434.5\\" y1=\\"46\\" x2=\\"434.5\\" y2=\\"728\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-s-lifeline\\" stroke-width=\\"1\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"4 4\\"/><rect x=\\"12\\" y=\\"122\\" width=\\"475.0\\" height=\\"134.0\\" rx=\\"4\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-s-frameStroke\\"/><path d=\\"M 12 122 h 90 l 8 16 v 8 h -98 z\\" fill=\\"#eef1f6\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-f-frameLabelFill sq-s-frameStroke\\"/><text x=\\"20\\" y=\\"138\\" font-size=\\"11\\" fill=\\"#5c6673\\" class=\\"sq-f-weak\\">alt 缓存里没有</text><rect x=\\"12\\" y=\\"552\\" width=\\"475.0\\" height=\\"162.0\\" rx=\\"4\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-s-frameStroke\\"/><path d=\\"M 12 552 h 79 l 8 16 v 8 h -87 z\\" fill=\\"#eef1f6\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-f-frameLabelFill sq-s-frameStroke\\"/><text x=\\"20\\" y=\\"568\\" font-size=\\"11\\" fill=\\"#5c6673\\" class=\\"sq-f-weak\\">alt 资源没变</text><line x1=\\"12\\" y1=\\"639\\" x2=\\"487.0\\" y2=\\"639\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-s-frameStroke\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"4 4\\"/><text x=\\"20\\" y=\\"653\\" font-size=\\"11\\" fill=\\"#5c6673\\" class=\\"sq-f-weak\\">资源有更新</text><rect x=\\"18.0\\" y=\\"14\\" width=\\"76\\" height=\\"32\\" rx=\\"5\\" fill=\\"#f3f5f9\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-f-boxFill sq-s-boxStroke\\"/><text x=\\"56.0\\" y=\\"34.5\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">浏览器</text><rect x=\\"18.0\\" y=\\"728\\" width=\\"76\\" height=\\"32\\" rx=\\"5\\" fill=\\"#f3f5f9\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-f-boxFill sq-s-boxStroke\\"/><text x=\\"56.0\\" y=\\"748.5\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">浏览器</text><rect x=\\"235.0\\" y=\\"14\\" width=\\"99\\" height=\\"32\\" rx=\\"5\\" fill=\\"#f3f5f9\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-f-boxFill sq-s-boxStroke\\"/><text x=\\"284.5\\" y=\\"34.5\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">DNS 服务器</text><rect x=\\"235.0\\" y=\\"728\\" width=\\"99\\" height=\\"32\\" rx=\\"5\\" fill=\\"#f3f5f9\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-f-boxFill sq-s-boxStroke\\"/><text x=\\"284.5\\" y=\\"748.5\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">DNS 服务器</text><rect x=\\"388.0\\" y=\\"14\\" width=\\"93\\" height=\\"32\\" rx=\\"5\\" fill=\\"#f3f5f9\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-f-boxFill sq-s-boxStroke\\"/><text x=\\"434.5\\" y=\\"34.5\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">网站服务器</text><rect x=\\"388.0\\" y=\\"728\\" width=\\"93\\" height=\\"32\\" rx=\\"5\\" fill=\\"#f3f5f9\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-f-boxFill sq-s-boxStroke\\"/><text x=\\"434.5\\" y=\\"748.5\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">网站服务器</text><text x=\\"114.0\\" y=\\"84\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"start\\">查浏览器和系统缓存</text><path d=\\"M 56 70 H 102 V 104 H 62\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\"/><path d=\\"M 55 104 L 63 99.5 L 63 108.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"43.0\\" cy=\\"70\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"43.0\\" y=\\"73.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">1</text><text x=\\"170.3\\" y=\\"167\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">查询域名对应的 IP</text><line x1=\\"56\\" y1=\\"179\\" x2=\\"277.5\\" y2=\\"179\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\"/><path d=\\"M 284.5 179 L 276.5 174.5 L 276.5 183.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"69.0\\" cy=\\"179\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"69.0\\" y=\\"182.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">2</text><text x=\\"170.3\\" y=\\"214\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">返回 IP 和 TTL</text><line x1=\\"284.5\\" y1=\\"226\\" x2=\\"63\\" y2=\\"226\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"5 4\\"/><path d=\\"M 56 226 L 64 221.5 L 64 230.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"271.5\\" cy=\\"226\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"271.5\\" y=\\"229.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">3</text><text x=\\"245.3\\" y=\\"281\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">TCP 握手 SYN</text><line x1=\\"56\\" y1=\\"293\\" x2=\\"427.5\\" y2=\\"293\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\"/><path d=\\"M 434.5 293 L 426.5 288.5 L 426.5 297.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"69.0\\" cy=\\"293\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"69.0\\" y=\\"296.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">4</text><text x=\\"245.3\\" y=\\"328\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">SYN + ACK</text><line x1=\\"434.5\\" y1=\\"340\\" x2=\\"63\\" y2=\\"340\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"5 4\\"/><path d=\\"M 56 340 L 64 335.5 L 64 344.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"421.5\\" cy=\\"340\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"421.5\\" y=\\"343.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">5</text><text x=\\"245.3\\" y=\\"375\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">ACK，连接建立</text><line x1=\\"56\\" y1=\\"387\\" x2=\\"427.5\\" y2=\\"387\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\"/><path d=\\"M 434.5 387 L 426.5 382.5 L 426.5 391.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"69.0\\" cy=\\"387\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"69.0\\" y=\\"390.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">6</text><text x=\\"245.3\\" y=\\"422\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">TLS 握手（HTTPS 才有）</text><line x1=\\"56\\" y1=\\"434\\" x2=\\"427.5\\" y2=\\"434\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\"/><path d=\\"M 434.5 434 L 426.5 429.5 L 426.5 438.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"69.0\\" cy=\\"434\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"69.0\\" y=\\"437.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">7</text><text x=\\"245.3\\" y=\\"469\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">证书和密钥协商结果</text><line x1=\\"434.5\\" y1=\\"481\\" x2=\\"63\\" y2=\\"481\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"5 4\\"/><path d=\\"M 56 481 L 64 476.5 L 64 485.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"421.5\\" cy=\\"481\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"421.5\\" y=\\"484.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">8</text><text x=\\"245.3\\" y=\\"516\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">发送 HTTP 请求（带缓存校验头）</text><line x1=\\"56\\" y1=\\"528\\" x2=\\"427.5\\" y2=\\"528\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\"/><path d=\\"M 434.5 528 L 426.5 523.5 L 426.5 532.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"69.0\\" cy=\\"528\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"69.0\\" y=\\"531.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">9</text><text x=\\"245.3\\" y=\\"597\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">304，直接用本地缓存</text><line x1=\\"434.5\\" y1=\\"609\\" x2=\\"63\\" y2=\\"609\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"5 4\\"/><path d=\\"M 56 609 L 64 604.5 L 64 613.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"421.5\\" cy=\\"609\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"421.5\\" y=\\"612.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">10</text><text x=\\"245.3\\" y=\\"672\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">200 和新内容</text><line x1=\\"434.5\\" y1=\\"684\\" x2=\\"63\\" y2=\\"684\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"5 4\\"/><path d=\\"M 56 684 L 64 679.5 L 64 688.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"421.5\\" cy=\\"684\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"421.5\\" y=\\"687.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">11</text></svg></div></div>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>部分用户打不开活动页，服务端监控一切正常，你先怀疑什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>先怀疑请求根本没到服务器。让用户 <code>nslookup</code> 一下域名，看解析出来的 <code>IP</code> 对不对，再看是不是集中在某个运营商或地区。服务端正常只能证明到了的请求是好的，这时候回滚前端代码没用。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>用户改 <code>hosts</code> 指定 <code>IP</code> 后就能打开了，说明什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>说明服务器和页面本身是好的，问题在域名解析：可能是某个运营商 <code>DNS</code> 缓存了旧记录，或者被劫持了。去不同网络下查解析结果，确认后修记录、等 <code>TTL</code> 过期，<code>App</code> 里可以考虑上 <code>HTTPDNS</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>海外落地页引了五个第三方域名，首屏慢，又不能删，怎么优化？</strong></p>\\n<p>关键的一两个域名加 <code>&lt;link rel=&quot;preconnect&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn.example.com&quot; crossorigin&gt;</code>，提前把 <code>DNS</code>、<code>TCP</code>、<code>TLS</code> 做掉；次要的用 <code>dns-prefetch</code>。别全加 <code>preconnect</code>，建好的连接大约十秒没用上就会被关，白占资源。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>HTTP/2</code> 都多路复用了，为什么还说有队头阻塞？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>HTTP/2</code> 解决的是应用层：一个连接里多个请求可以交错传。但底下还是一条 <code>TCP</code>，丢一个包，后面所有流的数据都得等它重传完才能交给上层。<code>HTTP/3</code> 把传输层换成 <code>QUIC</code>，每个流独立，丢包只影响自己那个流。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>静态资源设了长缓存，运营换了图用户却看不到，怎么兼顾？</strong></p>\\n<p>资源文件名带内容 <code>hash</code>，<code>max-age</code> 设一年再加 <code>immutable</code>；入口 <code>HTML</code> 用 <code>no-cache</code> 每次协商。换图就是换了文件名，<code>HTML</code> 一更新新地址就生效，旧缓存自然不再被引用。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_1-udp\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_1-udp\\">#</a> 1 UDP</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>面向报文：应用给多大一块就发多大一块，不拆不拼，接收方一次读一整个报文</li>\\n<li>无连接、不确认、不重传、不保证顺序；头部只有 <code>8</code> 字节（<code>TCP</code> 至少 <code>20</code>）</li>\\n<li>没有拥塞控制，网再差也照原速发：丢包换低延迟，所以音视频、直播、游戏用它</li>\\n<li>支持单播、多播、广播，<code>TCP</code> 只能一对一</li>\\n<li>可靠性可以在上层补：<code>QUIC</code>（<code>HTTP/3</code>）、<code>WebRTC</code> 都跑在 <code>UDP</code> 上</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong><code>UDP</code> 就是个只管发、不管到没到的搬运工：不建连接、不确认、不重传，也不排序。</strong> 好处是简单、头部只有 <code>8</code> 字节、延迟低，网络差了也不会像 <code>TCP</code> 那样降速等重传，所以视频通话、游戏这种「晚到不如不到」的场景用它。它还是面向报文的，发一个包就是一个完整的消息，不像 <code>TCP</code> 是字节流还得自己切消息边界。现在很多新协议是在 <code>UDP</code> 上自己补可靠性，比如 <code>HTTP/3</code> 的 <code>QUIC</code>，相当于把 <code>TCP</code> 那套搬到用户态重写了一遍。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>1.1 面向报文</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p><code>UDP</code> 是一个面向报文（报文可以理解为一段段的数据）的协议。意思就是 <code>UDP</code> 只是报文的搬运工，不会对报文进行任何拆分和拼接操作</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p>具体来说</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>在发送端，应用层将数据传递给传输层的 <code>UDP</code> 协议，<code>UDP</code> 只会给数据增加一个 <code>UDP</code> 头标识下是 <code>UDP</code> 协议，然后就传递给网络层了</li>\\n<li>在接收端，网络层将数据传递给传输层，<code>UDP</code> 只去除 <code>IP</code> 报文头就传递给应用层，不会任何拼接操作</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>1.2 不可靠性</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>UDP</code> 是无连接的，也就是说通信不需要建立和断开连接。</li>\\n<li><code>UDP</code> 也是不可靠的。协议收到什么数据就传递什么数据，并且也不会备份数据，对方能不能收到是不关心的</li>\\n<li><code>UDP</code> 没有拥塞控制，一直会以恒定的速度发送数据。即使网络条件不好，也不会对发送速率进行调整。这样实现的弊端就是在网络条件不好的情况下可能会导致丢包，但是优点也很明显，在某些实时性要求高的场景（比如电话会议）就需要使用 UDP 而不是 <code>TCP</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>1.3 高效</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>因为 <code>UDP</code> 没有 <code>TCP</code> 那么复杂，需要保证数据不丢失且有序到达。所以 <code>UDP</code> 的头部开销小，只有八字节，相比 <code>TCP</code> 的至少二十字节要少得多，在传输数据报文时是很高效的</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://s.poetries.top/gitee/2020/09/226.png\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<p><strong>头部包含了以下几个数据</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>两个十六位的端口号，分别为源端口（可选字段）和目标端口\\n整个数据报文的长度</li>\\n<li>整个数据报文的检验和（<code>IPv4</code> 可选 字段），该字段用于发现头部信息和数据中的错误</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>1.4 传输方式</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p><code>UDP</code> 不止支持一对一的传输方式，同样支持一对多，多对多，多对一的方式，也就是说 UDP 提供了单播，多播，广播的功能</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>视频会议丢了一个音频包，为什么不重传？</strong></p>\\n<p>等重传回来，那一段声音的播放时间早就过了，播出来反而更卡。实时音视频宁可丢一点，用插值或前向纠错补，也不能让后面的数据等它。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>客户端把 <code>UDP</code> 收到的数据当字节流按固定长度切，有什么问题？</strong></p>\\n<p>模型错了。<code>UDP</code> 一个数据报就是一个消息，边界协议帮你保好了，直接按报文解析就行。反过来要注意单个报文别超过 <code>MTU</code>（一般按 <code>1200</code> 字节左右算），太大会被 <code>IP</code> 层分片，任何一片丢了整个报文就没了。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>网络变差后丢包暴涨，发送端还在匀速发，<code>UDP</code> 会自己降速吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，<code>UDP</code> 没有拥塞控制，得在应用层自己做。比如 <code>WebRTC</code> 会根据丢包和延迟动态调码率；什么都不做的话，越发越堵，丢得越多。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>告警数据量小、频率高，但一条都不能丢，用 <code>UDP</code> 还是 <code>TCP</code>？</strong></p>\\n<p>一条都不能丢就别裸用 <code>UDP</code>，否则确认、重传、去重都得自己写，等于重造一个 <code>TCP</code>。直接用 <code>TCP</code> 或基于它的 <code>HTTP</code>、<code>MQTT</code>；对延迟特别敏感再考虑 <code>QUIC</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>UDP</code> 有校验和，是不是就能保证数据可靠？</strong></p>\\n<p>校验和只能发现包坏没坏，坏了就丢掉，不会通知对方也不会重传。可靠说的是「保证送到、按顺序、不重复」，这些 <code>UDP</code> 一个都不管。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_2-tcp\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_2-tcp\\">#</a> 2 TCP</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>头部三个关键字段：<code>Sequence Number</code>（按序拼接）、<code>Acknowledgement Number</code>（期望的下一个字节）、<code>Window Size</code>（流量控制）</li>\\n<li>三次握手是让双方都确认「我能发、你能收」，第三次还能挡掉迟到的旧 <code>SYN</code>，免得服务端白开连接</li>\\n<li>四次挥手是因为全双工：一边说完了另一边可能还有数据，<code>ACK</code> 和 <code>FIN</code> 分两次发</li>\\n<li>主动关闭方要等 <code>2MSL</code> 的 <code>TIME_WAIT</code>，防最后一个 <code>ACK</code> 丢了；大量 <code>CLOSE_WAIT</code> 多半是代码没关连接</li>\\n<li>前端记成本：<code>TCP</code> 握手一个 <code>RTT</code>，<code>TLS 1.2</code> 再加两个、<code>TLS 1.3</code> 加一个，所以要复用连接、<code>preconnect</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong><code>TCP</code> 靠序列号、确认号和重传保证数据可靠有序，靠窗口控制发送速度，连接要三次握手建立、四次挥手断开。</strong> 三次握手说白了是双方各确认一次「你能收到我」，第三次还能防止一个迟到的旧连接请求让服务端白白挂着资源。挥手要四次，是因为两个方向是分开关的，客户端说完了，服务端可能还有数据没发完。前端最该记的是成本：一次握手就是一个往返，加上 <code>TLS</code> 更多，所以 <code>keep-alive</code>、<code>HTTP/2</code> 复用连接、<code>preconnect</code> 都是在省这个。</p>\\n</section>\\n<div class=\\"vp-seq\\"><div class=\\"vp-seq__bar\\"><span class=\\"vp-seq__hint\\">时序图 · 2 个参与者 / 8 步</span></div><div class=\\"vp-seq__canvas\\"><svg xmlns=\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\" class=\\"vp-seq-svg\\" width=\\"400\\" height=\\"882\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 400 882\\" font-family=\'-apple-system, \\"PingFang SC\\", \\"Microsoft YaHei\\", \\"Helvetica Neue\\", Arial, sans-serif\' role=\\"img\\" aria-label=\\"时序图\\"><rect x=\\"0\\" y=\\"0\\" width=\\"400\\" height=\\"882\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" class=\\"sq-f-bg\\"/><line x1=\\"90.5\\" y1=\\"46\\" x2=\\"90.5\\" y2=\\"834\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-s-lifeline\\" stroke-width=\\"1\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"4 4\\"/><line x1=\\"271.5\\" y1=\\"46\\" x2=\\"271.5\\" y2=\\"834\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-s-lifeline\\" stroke-width=\\"1\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"4 4\\"/><rect x=\\"12\\" y=\\"272\\" width=\\"303.5\\" height=\\"134.0\\" rx=\\"4\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-s-frameStroke\\"/><path d=\\"M 12 272 h 147 l 8 16 v 8 h -155 z\\" fill=\\"#eef1f6\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-f-frameLabelFill sq-s-frameStroke\\"/><text x=\\"20\\" y=\\"288\\" font-size=\\"11\\" fill=\\"#5c6673\\" class=\\"sq-f-weak\\">opt 服务端还有数据没发完</text><rect x=\\"12\\" y=\\"610\\" width=\\"303.5\\" height=\\"210.0\\" rx=\\"4\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-s-frameStroke\\"/><path d=\\"M 12 610 h 122 l 8 16 v 8 h -130 z\\" fill=\\"#eef1f6\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-f-frameLabelFill sq-s-frameStroke\\"/><text x=\\"20\\" y=\\"626\\" font-size=\\"11\\" fill=\\"#5c6673\\" class=\\"sq-f-weak\\">alt 最后的 ACK 丢了</text><line x1=\\"12\\" y1=\\"744\\" x2=\\"315.5\\" y2=\\"744\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-s-frameStroke\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"4 4\\"/><text x=\\"20\\" y=\\"758\\" font-size=\\"11\\" fill=\\"#5c6673\\" class=\\"sq-f-weak\\">正常收到</text><rect x=\\"18.0\\" y=\\"14\\" width=\\"145\\" height=\\"32\\" rx=\\"5\\" fill=\\"#f3f5f9\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-f-boxFill sq-s-boxStroke\\"/><text x=\\"90.5\\" y=\\"34.5\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">客户端（主动关闭）</text><rect x=\\"18.0\\" y=\\"834\\" width=\\"145\\" height=\\"32\\" rx=\\"5\\" fill=\\"#f3f5f9\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-f-boxFill sq-s-boxStroke\\"/><text x=\\"90.5\\" y=\\"854.5\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">客户端（主动关闭）</text><rect x=\\"233.5\\" y=\\"14\\" width=\\"76\\" height=\\"32\\" rx=\\"5\\" fill=\\"#f3f5f9\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-f-boxFill sq-s-boxStroke\\"/><text x=\\"271.5\\" y=\\"34.5\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">服务端</text><rect x=\\"233.5\\" y=\\"834\\" width=\\"76\\" height=\\"32\\" rx=\\"5\\" fill=\\"#f3f5f9\\" stroke=\\"#c8cfda\\" class=\\"sq-f-boxFill sq-s-boxStroke\\"/><text x=\\"271.5\\" y=\\"854.5\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">服务端</text><text x=\\"181.0\\" y=\\"77\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">FIN，我这边没数据要发了</text><line x1=\\"90.5\\" y1=\\"89\\" x2=\\"264.5\\" y2=\\"89\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\"/><path d=\\"M 271.5 89 L 263.5 84.5 L 263.5 93.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"103.5\\" cy=\\"89\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"103.5\\" y=\\"92.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">1</text><rect x=\\"29.5\\" y=\\"113\\" width=\\"122.0\\" height=\\"32\\" rx=\\"4\\" fill=\\"#fff8e6\\" stroke=\\"#ecd9a4\\" class=\\"sq-f-noteFill sq-s-noteStroke\\"/><text x=\\"38.5\\" y=\\"132\\" font-size=\\"12\\" fill=\\"#6b5321\\" class=\\"sq-f-noteText\\">进入 FIN_WAIT_1</text><text x=\\"181.0\\" y=\\"172\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">ACK，收到</text><line x1=\\"271.5\\" y1=\\"184\\" x2=\\"97.5\\" y2=\\"184\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"5 4\\"/><path d=\\"M 90.5 184 L 98.5 179.5 L 98.5 188.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"258.5\\" cy=\\"184\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"258.5\\" y=\\"187.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">2</text><rect x=\\"52.5\\" y=\\"208\\" width=\\"257.0\\" height=\\"48\\" rx=\\"4\\" fill=\\"#fff8e6\\" stroke=\\"#ecd9a4\\" class=\\"sq-f-noteFill sq-s-noteStroke\\"/><text x=\\"61.5\\" y=\\"227\\" font-size=\\"12\\" fill=\\"#6b5321\\" class=\\"sq-f-noteText\\">客户端 FIN_WAIT_2，服务端 CLOSE_WAI</text><text x=\\"61.5\\" y=\\"243\\" font-size=\\"12\\" fill=\\"#6b5321\\" class=\\"sq-f-noteText\\">T</text><text x=\\"181.0\\" y=\\"317\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">继续发剩余数据</text><line x1=\\"271.5\\" y1=\\"329\\" x2=\\"97.5\\" y2=\\"329\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\"/><path d=\\"M 90.5 329 L 98.5 324.5 L 98.5 333.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"258.5\\" cy=\\"329\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"258.5\\" y=\\"332.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">3</text><text x=\\"181.0\\" y=\\"364\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">ACK</text><line x1=\\"90.5\\" y1=\\"376\\" x2=\\"264.5\\" y2=\\"376\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"5 4\\"/><path d=\\"M 271.5 376 L 263.5 371.5 L 263.5 380.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"103.5\\" cy=\\"376\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"103.5\\" y=\\"379.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">4</text><text x=\\"181.0\\" y=\\"431\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">FIN，我也发完了</text><line x1=\\"271.5\\" y1=\\"443\\" x2=\\"97.5\\" y2=\\"443\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\"/><path d=\\"M 90.5 443 L 98.5 438.5 L 98.5 447.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"258.5\\" cy=\\"443\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"258.5\\" y=\\"446.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">5</text><rect x=\\"218.0\\" y=\\"467\\" width=\\"107.0\\" height=\\"32\\" rx=\\"4\\" fill=\\"#fff8e6\\" stroke=\\"#ecd9a4\\" class=\\"sq-f-noteFill sq-s-noteStroke\\"/><text x=\\"227.0\\" y=\\"486\\" font-size=\\"12\\" fill=\\"#6b5321\\" class=\\"sq-f-noteText\\">进入 LAST_ACK</text><text x=\\"181.0\\" y=\\"526\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">最后一个 ACK</text><line x1=\\"90.5\\" y1=\\"538\\" x2=\\"264.5\\" y2=\\"538\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"5 4\\"/><path d=\\"M 271.5 538 L 263.5 533.5 L 263.5 542.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"103.5\\" cy=\\"538\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"103.5\\" y=\\"541.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">6</text><rect x=\\"15.5\\" y=\\"562\\" width=\\"150.0\\" height=\\"32\\" rx=\\"4\\" fill=\\"#fff8e6\\" stroke=\\"#ecd9a4\\" class=\\"sq-f-noteFill sq-s-noteStroke\\"/><text x=\\"24.5\\" y=\\"581\\" font-size=\\"12\\" fill=\\"#6b5321\\" class=\\"sq-f-noteText\\">TIME_WAIT，等 2MSL</text><text x=\\"181.0\\" y=\\"655\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">超时重发 FIN</text><line x1=\\"271.5\\" y1=\\"667\\" x2=\\"97.5\\" y2=\\"667\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\"/><path d=\\"M 90.5 667 L 98.5 662.5 L 98.5 671.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"258.5\\" cy=\\"667\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"258.5\\" y=\\"670.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">7</text><text x=\\"181.0\\" y=\\"702\\" font-size=\\"13\\" fill=\\"#1f2329\\" class=\\"sq-f-text\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\">再回 ACK，重新计时</text><line x1=\\"90.5\\" y1=\\"714\\" x2=\\"264.5\\" y2=\\"714\\" stroke=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-s-line\\" stroke-width=\\"1.4\\" stroke-dasharray=\\"5 4\\"/><path d=\\"M 271.5 714 L 263.5 709.5 L 263.5 718.5 z\\" fill=\\"#8c97a8\\" class=\\"sq-f-line\\"/><circle cx=\\"103.5\\" cy=\\"714\\" r=\\"8\\" fill=\\"#e66000\\"/><text x=\\"103.5\\" y=\\"717.5\\" font-size=\\"10\\" fill=\\"#ffffff\\" text-anchor=\\"middle\\" font-weight=\\"600\\">8</text><rect x=\\"207.0\\" y=\\"766\\" width=\\"129.0\\" height=\\"32\\" rx=\\"4\\" fill=\\"#fff8e6\\" stroke=\\"#ecd9a4\\" class=\\"sq-f-noteFill sq-s-noteStroke\\"/><text x=\\"216.0\\" y=\\"785\\" font-size=\\"12\\" fill=\\"#6b5321\\" class=\\"sq-f-noteText\\">服务端进入 CLOSED</text></svg></div></div>\\n<p><strong>2.1 头部</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p><code>TCP</code> 头部比 <code>UDP</code> 头部复杂的多</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://s.poetries.top/gitee/2020/09/227.png\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>对于 <code>TCP</code> 头部来说，以下几个字段是很重要的</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>Sequence number</code>，这个序号保证了 <code>TCP</code> 传输的报文都是有序的，对端可以通过序号顺序的拼接报文</li>\\n<li><code>Acknowledgement Number</code>，这个序号表示数据接收端期望接收的下一个字节的编号是多少，同时也表示上一个序号的数据已经收到</li>\\n<li><code>Window Size</code>，窗口大小，表示还能接收多少字节的数据，用于流量控制</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>标识符</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>URG=1</code>：该字段为一表示本数据报的数据部分包含紧急信息，是一个高优先级数据报文，此时紧急指针有效。紧急数据一定位于当前数据包数据部分的最前面，紧急指针标明了紧急数据的尾部。</li>\\n<li><code>ACK=1</code>：该字段为一表示确认号字段有效。此外，<code>TCP</code> 还规定在连接建立后传送的所有报文段都必须把 <code>ACK</code> 置为一\\n<code>PSH=1</code>：该字段为一表示接收端应该立即将数据 push 给应用层，而不是等到缓冲区满后再提交。</li>\\n<li><code>RST=1</code>：该字段为一表示当前 <code>TCP</code> 连接出现严重问题，可能需要重新建立 <code>TCP</code> 连接，也可以用于拒绝非法的报文段和拒绝连接请求。</li>\\n<li><code>SYN=1</code>：当<code>SYN=1</code>，<code>ACK=0</code>时，表示当前报文段是一个连接请求报文。当<code>SYN=1</code>，<code>ACK=1</code>时，表示当前报文段是一个同意建立连接的应答报文。</li>\\n<li><code>FIN=1</code>：该字段为一表示此报文段是一个释放连接的请求报文</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>2.2 状态机</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p><code>HTTP</code> 是无连接的，所以作为下层的 <code>TCP</code> 协议也是无连接的，虽然看似 <code>TCP</code> 将两端连接了起来，但是其实只是两端共同维护了一个状态</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://s.poetries.top/gitee/2020/09/228.png\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>TCP</code> 的状态机是很复杂的，并且与建立断开连接时的握手息息相关，接下来就来详细描述下两种握手。</li>\\n<li>在这之前需要了解一个重要的性能指标 RTT。该指标表示发送端发送数据到接收到对端数据所需的往返时间</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>建立连接三次握手</strong></p>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://s.poetries.top/gitee/2020/09/229.png\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>在 <code>TCP</code> 协议中，主动发起请求的一端为客户端，被动连接的一端称为服务端。不管是客户端还是服务端，<code>TCP</code>连接建立完后都能发送和接收数据，所以 <code>TCP</code> 也是一个全双工的协议。</li>\\n<li>起初，两端都为 <code>CLOSED</code> 状态。在通信开始前，双方都会创建 <code>TCB</code>。 服务器创建完 <code>TCB</code> 后遍进入 <code>LISTEN</code> 状态，此时开始等待客户端发送数据</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>第一次握手</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>客户端向服务端发送连接请求报文段。该报文段中包含自身的数据通讯初始序号。请求发送后，客户端便进入 SYN-SENT 状态，x 表示客户端的数据通信初始序号。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>第二次握手</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>服务端收到连接请求报文段后，如果同意连接，则会发送一个应答，该应答中也会包含自身的数据通讯初始序号，发送完成后便进入 <code>SYN-RECEIVED</code> 状态。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>第三次握手</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>当客户端收到连接同意的应答后，还要向服务端发送一个确认报文。客户端发完这个报文段后便进入<code>ESTABLISHED</code> 状态，服务端收到这个应答后也进入 <code>ESTABLISHED</code>状态，此时连接建立成功。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<ul>\\n<li>PS：第三次握手可以包含数据，通过 <code>TCP</code> 快速打开（<code>TFO</code>）技术。其实只要涉及到握手的协议，都可以使用类似 <code>TFO</code> 的方式，客户端和服务端存储相同 <code>cookie</code>，下次握手时发出 <code>cookie</code>达到减少 <code>RTT</code> 的目的</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>你是否有疑惑明明两次握手就可以建立起连接，为什么还需要第三次应答？</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>因为这是为了防止失效的连接请求报文段被服务端接收，从而产生错误</li>\\n</ul>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>可以想象如下场景。客户端发送了一个连接请求 A，但是因为网络原因造成了超时，这时 TCP 会启动超时重传的机制再次发送一个连接请求 B。此时请求顺利到达服务端，服务端应答完就建立了请求。如果连接请求 A 在两端关闭后终于抵达了服务端，那么这时服务端会认为客户端又需要建立 TCP 连接，从而应答了该请求并进入 <code>ESTABLISHED</code> 状态。此时客户端其实是 CLOSED 状态，那么就会导致服务端一直等待，造成资源的浪费</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>PS：在建立连接中，任意一端掉线，TCP 都会重发 SYN 包，一般会重试五次，在建立连接中可能会遇到 SYN FLOOD 攻击。遇到这种情况你可以选择调低重试次数或者干脆在不能处理的情况下拒绝请求</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>断开链接四次握手</strong></p>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://s.poetries.top/gitee/2020/09/230.png\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p><code>TCP</code> 是全双工的，在断开连接时两端都需要发送 <code>FIN</code> 和 <code>ACK</code>。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>第一次握手</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>若客户端 A 认为数据发送完成，则它需要向服务端 B 发送连接释放请求。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>第二次握手</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>B 收到连接释放请求后，会告诉应用层要释放 TCP 链接。然后会发送 ACK 包，并进入 CLOSE_WAIT 状态，表示 A 到 B 的连接已经释放，不接收 A 发的数据了。但是因为 TCP 连接时双向的，所以 B 仍旧可以发送数据给 A。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>第三次握手</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>B 如果此时还有没发完的数据会继续发送，完毕后会向 A 发送连接释放请求，然后 B 便进入 LAST-ACK 状态。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>PS：通过延迟确认的技术（通常有时间限制，否则对方会误认为需要重传），可以将第二次和第三次握手合并，延迟 ACK 包的发送。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>第四次握手</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>A 收到释放请求后，向 B 发送确认应答，此时 A 进入 TIME-WAIT 状态。该状态会持续 2MSL（最大段生存期，指报文段在网络中生存的时间，超时会被抛弃） 时间，若该时间段内没有 B 的重发请求的话，就进入 CLOSED 状态。当 B 收到确认应答后，也便进入 CLOSED 状态。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>为什么 A 要进入 TIME-WAIT 状态，等待 2MSL 时间后才进入 CLOSED 状态？</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<ul>\\n<li>为了保证 B 能收到 A 的确认应答。若 A 发完确认应答后直接进入 CLOSED 状态，如果确认应答因为网络问题一直没有到达，那么会造成 B 不能正常关闭</li>\\n</ul>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>抓包看到报文段乱序到达，<code>TCP</code> 怎么保证交给应用的是有序的？</strong></p>\\n<p>每个字节都有序号，接收端按 <code>Sequence Number</code> 把乱序的段先放缓冲区，缺的那段到了才一起交给应用。<code>ACK</code> 回的是「我期望的下一个字节」，中间有空洞就一直回同一个值，发送端收到三个重复 <code>ACK</code> 就快速重传。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>只用两次握手会出什么问题？</strong></p>\\n<p>客户端一个早就超时的旧 <code>SYN</code> 迟到了，服务端收到回个 <code>SYN+ACK</code> 就当连接建好，开始等数据，可客户端根本不认这个连接，服务端资源就白占了。第三次 <code>ACK</code> 就是让服务端确认对方确实还要这个连接。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>服务端出现大量 <code>CLOSE_WAIT</code>，是网络问题吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>基本是代码问题。<code>CLOSE_WAIT</code> 表示对端已经发了 <code>FIN</code>、我方也回了 <code>ACK</code>，但应用一直没调 <code>close()</code>。去查连接池、<code>HTTP</code> 客户端、数据库连接有没有在异常分支里漏关。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>网关大量 <code>TIME_WAIT</code> 占满端口，能不能发完最后一个 <code>ACK</code> 就立刻释放？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能直接去掉。最后那个 <code>ACK</code> 丢了，对方会重发 <code>FIN</code>，没有 <code>TIME_WAIT</code> 就只能回 <code>RST</code>；它还要等旧连接的迟到报文在网络里消失，免得串到新连接上。正确方向是少建短连接：开 <code>keep-alive</code>、用连接池，<code>Linux</code> 上可以开 <code>tcp_tw_reuse</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>接收方处理慢了，发送方怎么知道要放慢？</strong></p>\\n<p>接收方在每个 <code>ACK</code> 里带上 <code>Window Size</code>，告诉对方「我还剩多少缓冲」，降到 <code>0</code> 发送方就停。这是流量控制，管的是接收方的处理能力；拥塞控制看的是网络，靠拥塞窗口和慢启动，两件事别混。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-http\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-http\\">#</a> 3 HTTP</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>无状态：每个请求独立，状态靠 <code>Cookie</code> / <code>token</code> 带上，好处是哪台服务器都能处理，方便横向扩展</li>\\n<li><code>GET</code> 和 <code>POST</code> 本质是语义：<code>GET</code> 只读、幂等、可缓存，参数进 <code>URL</code> 和历史记录；<code>POST</code> 提交数据、放请求体。不走 <code>HTTPS</code> 两个都是明文</li>\\n<li><code>URL</code> 长度限制来自浏览器和服务器实现，不是 <code>RFC</code> 规定的</li>\\n<li>状态码易混的几对：<code>301</code> 永久 / <code>302</code> 临时；<code>307</code>、<code>308</code> 保证不改请求方法；<code>304</code> 协商缓存命中；<code>401</code> 没认证 / <code>403</code> 认证了但没权限</li>\\n<li>首部按用途记：缓存（<code>Cache-Control</code>、<code>ETag</code>、<code>If-None-Match</code>）、内容（<code>Content-Type</code>）、范围（<code>Range</code>）</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong><code>HTTP</code> 是无状态的请求响应协议，面试最常问的是 <code>GET</code> 和 <code>POST</code> 的区别，还有状态码。</strong> <code>GET</code> 和 <code>POST</code> 的本质区别是语义：<code>GET</code> 是读，要求幂等、能被缓存，参数在 <code>URL</code> 里会留在历史和日志；<code>POST</code> 是提交，会改服务器状态，数据放在请求体。至于「<code>POST</code> 更安全」，抓包看两个都是明文，安全靠 <code>HTTPS</code>。状态码我按段记，再把容易混的几对单独记：<code>301</code> 和 <code>302</code>、<code>302</code> 和 <code>307</code>、<code>401</code> 和 <code>403</code>。</p>\\n</section>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p><code>HTTP</code> 协议是个无状态协议，不会保存状态</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>3.1 Post 和 Get 的区别</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>Get</code>请求能缓存，<code>Post</code> 不能</li>\\n<li><code>Post</code> 相对 <code>Get</code>安全一点点，因为<code>Get</code> 请求都包含在 <code>URL</code> 里，且会被浏览器保存历史纪录，<code>Post</code> 不会，但是在抓包的情况下都是一样的。</li>\\n<li><code>Post</code> 可以通过 <code>request body</code>来传输比 <code>Get</code> 更多的数据，<code>Get</code>没有这个技术</li>\\n<li><code>URL</code>有长度限制，会影响 <code>Get</code>请求，但是这个长度限制是浏览器规定的，不是 <code>RFC</code> 规定的</li>\\n<li><code>Post</code> 支持更多的编码类型且不对数据类型限制</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>3.2 常见状态码</strong></p>\\n<p><strong>2XX 成功</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>200 OK</code>，表示从客户端发来的请求在服务器端被正确处理</li>\\n<li><code>204 No content</code>，表示请求成功，但响应报文不含实体的主体部分</li>\\n<li><code>205 Reset Content</code>，表示请求成功，但响应报文不含实体的主体部分，但是与 <code>204</code> 响应不同在于要求请求方重置内容</li>\\n<li><code>206 Partial Content</code>，进行范围请求</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>3XX 重定向</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>301 moved permanently</code>，永久性重定向，表示资源已被分配了新的 URL</li>\\n<li><code>302 found</code>，临时性重定向，表示资源临时被分配了新的 URL</li>\\n<li><code>303 see other</code>，表示资源存在着另一个 URL，应使用 GET 方法丁香获取资源</li>\\n<li><code>304 not modified</code>，表示服务器允许访问资源，但因发生请求未满足条件的情况</li>\\n<li><code>307 temporary redirect</code>，临时重定向，和302含义类似，但是期望客户端保持请求方法不变向新的地址发出请求</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>4XX 客户端错误</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>400 bad request</code>，请求报文存在语法错误</li>\\n<li><code>401 unauthorized</code>，表示发送的请求需要有通过 <code>HTTP</code>认证的认证信息</li>\\n<li><code>403 forbidden</code>，表示对请求资源的访问被服务器拒绝</li>\\n<li><code>404 not found</code>，表示在服务器上没有找到请求的资源</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>5XX 服务器错误</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>500 internal sever error</code>，表示服务器端在执行请求时发生了错误</li>\\n<li><code>501 Not Implemented</code>，表示服务器不支持当前请求所需要的某个功能</li>\\n<li><code>503 service unavailable</code>，表明服务器暂时处于超负载或正在停机维护，无法处理请求</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>3.3 HTTP 首部</strong></p>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>通用字段</th>\\n<th>作用</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Cache-Control</code></td>\\n<td>控制缓存的行为</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Connection</code></td>\\n<td>浏览器想要优先使用的连接类型，比如 <code>keep-alive</code></td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Date</code></td>\\n<td>创建报文时间</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Pragma</code></td>\\n<td>报文指令</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Via</code></td>\\n<td>代理服务器相关信息</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Transfer-Encoding</code></td>\\n<td>传输编码方式</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Upgrade</code></td>\\n<td>要求客户端升级协议</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Warning</code></td>\\n<td>在内容中可能存在错误</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>请求字段</th>\\n<th>作用</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Accept</code></td>\\n<td>能正确接收的媒体类型</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Accept-Charset</code></td>\\n<td>能正确接收的字符集</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Accept-Encoding</code></td>\\n<td>能正确接收的编码格式列表</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Accept-Language</code></td>\\n<td>能正确接收的语言列表</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Expect</code></td>\\n<td>期待服务端的指定行为</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>From</code></td>\\n<td>请求方邮箱地址</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Host</code></td>\\n<td>服务器的域名</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>If-Match</code></td>\\n<td>两端资源标记比较</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>If-Modified-Since</code></td>\\n<td>本地资源未修改返回 304（比较时间）</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>If-None-Match</code></td>\\n<td>本地资源未修改返回 304（比较标记）</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>User-Agent</code></td>\\n<td>客户端信息</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Max-Forwards</code></td>\\n<td>限制可被代理及网关转发的次数</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Proxy-Authorization</code></td>\\n<td>向代理服务器发送验证信息</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Range</code></td>\\n<td>请求某个内容的一部分</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Referer</code></td>\\n<td>表示浏览器所访问的前一个页面</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>TE</code></td>\\n<td>传输编码方式</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>响应字段</th>\\n<th>作用</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Accept-Ranges</code></td>\\n<td>是否支持某些种类的范围</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Age</code></td>\\n<td>资源在代理缓存中存在的时间</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>ETag</code></td>\\n<td>资源标识</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Location</code></td>\\n<td>客户端重定向到某个 <code>URL</code></td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Proxy-Authenticate</code></td>\\n<td>向代理服务器发送验证信息</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Server</code></td>\\n<td>服务器名字</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>WWW-Authenticate</code></td>\\n<td>获取资源需要的验证信息</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>实体字段</th>\\n<th>作用</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Allow</code></td>\\n<td>资源的正确请求方式</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Content-Encoding</code></td>\\n<td>内容的编码格式</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Content-Language</code></td>\\n<td>内容使用的语言</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Content-Length</code></td>\\n<td><code>request body</code> 长度</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Content-Location</code></td>\\n<td>返回数据的备用地址</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Content-MD5</code></td>\\n<td><code>Base64</code>加密格式的内容<code>MD5</code>检验值</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Content-Range</code></td>\\n<td>内容的位置范围</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Content-Type</code></td>\\n<td>内容的媒体类型</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Expires</code></td>\\n<td>内容的过期时间</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>Last_modified</code></td>\\n<td>内容的最后修改时间</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>用 <code>GET /orders/create?sku=1</code> 下单，有什么问题？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>GET</code> 应该是只读、幂等的，浏览器预加载、爬虫、用户刷新都可能再发一次，结果多下一单。参数还会留在历史记录和代理日志里。创建类操作用 <code>POST</code>，再加幂等键防重复提交。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>POST</code> 接口迁移后网关回 <code>302</code>，新地址收到的却是 <code>GET</code>，怎么办？</strong></p>\\n<p>历史原因，浏览器遇到 <code>302</code> 会把 <code>POST</code> 改成 <code>GET</code> 并丢掉请求体。要保持方法和请求体，临时迁移用 <code>307</code>，永久迁移用 <code>308</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>静态资源已经更新，浏览器还是一直拿到 <code>304</code>，查什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>看请求里的 <code>If-None-Match</code> / <code>If-Modified-Since</code>，和服务端新文件的 <code>ETag</code> / <code>Last-Modified</code> 对不对得上。常见原因是部署后文件修改时间没变，或者多台机器生成 <code>ETag</code> 的规则不一致导致误判。根治办法是文件名带 <code>hash</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>视频拖动进度条要从中间播，接口怎么配合？</strong></p>\\n<p>客户端发 <code>Range: bytes=1000000-</code>，服务端支持的话回 <code>206 Partial Content</code>，带上 <code>Content-Range: bytes 1000000-2999999/3000000</code>，并用 <code>Accept-Ranges: bytes</code> 声明能力。服务端不支持就会回 <code>200</code> 和整个文件，只能从头下。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>鉴权失败时用 <code>401</code> 还是 <code>403</code>？</strong></p>\\n<p>没登录、<code>token</code> 过期或无效用 <code>401</code>，前端收到就去刷新 <code>token</code> 或跳登录；登录了但没这个权限用 <code>403</code>，前端提示无权限，别跳登录。两个混用的话，前端拦截器就不知道该干什么。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_4-dns\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_4-dns\\">#</a> 4 DNS</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>把域名换成 <code>IP</code>，发生在 <code>TCP</code> 握手之前；一般由系统解析器做（<code>Chrome</code> 也有内置解析器，还支持 <code>DoH</code>）</li>\\n<li>查找顺序：浏览器缓存 → 系统缓存和 <code>hosts</code> → 本地 <code>DNS</code> 服务器（运营商或 <code>8.8.8.8</code> 这类公共 <code>DNS</code>）→ 根 → 顶级域（<code>.com</code>）→ 权威服务器</li>\\n<li>客户端问本地 <code>DNS</code> 是递归查询（你帮我查到底）；本地 <code>DNS</code> 往根、顶级域、权威一级级问是迭代查询</li>\\n<li>结果按 <code>TTL</code> 缓存，改解析不会立刻生效：切机房前先把 <code>TTL</code> 调小</li>\\n<li>前端优化：<code>dns-prefetch</code>、收敛第三方域名；移动端怕劫持可以上 <code>HTTPDNS</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong><code>DNS</code> 就是查通讯录：拿域名换 <code>IP</code>，这一步发生在建立 <code>TCP</code> 连接之前。</strong> 查的时候先看本地缓存，浏览器、系统、<code>hosts</code> 都没有，才去问配置的 <code>DNS</code> 服务器。客户端这一段一般是递归查询，意思是「你帮我查到底再告诉我」；本地 <code>DNS</code> 服务器再去问根服务器、<code>.com</code> 服务器、域名的权威服务器，这一段是迭代查询，每一级只告诉你下一步该去问谁。每条结果都带 <code>TTL</code>，所以改了解析不会马上全网生效。</p>\\n</section>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>DNS 的作用就是通过域名查询到具体的 IP。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<ul>\\n<li>因为 IP 存在数字和英文的组合（IPv6），很不利于人类记忆，所以就出现了域名。你可以把域名看成是某个 IP 的别名，DNS 就是去查询这个别名的真正名称是什么</li>\\n</ul>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>在 <code>TCP</code> 握手之前就已经进行了 <code>DNS</code> 查询，这个查询是操作系统自己做的。当你在浏览器中想访问 <code>www.google.com</code> 时，会进行一下操作</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<ul>\\n<li>操作系统会首先在本地缓存中查询</li>\\n<li>没有的话会去系统配置的 DNS 服务器中查询</li>\\n<li>如果这时候还没得话，会直接去 DNS 根服务器查询，这一步查询会找出负责 com 这个一级域名的服务器</li>\\n<li>然后去该服务器查询 google 这个二级域名</li>\\n<li>接下来三级域名的查询其实是我们配置的，你可以给 www 这个域名配置一个 IP，然后还可以给别的三级域名配置一个 IP</li>\\n</ul>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>以上介绍的是 DNS 迭代查询，还有种是递归查询，区别就是前者是由客户端去做请求，后者是由系统配置的 DNS 服务器做请求，得到结果后将数据返回给客户端。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>抓包只看到本机发了一次 <code>DNS</code> 请求就拿到了 <code>IP</code>，根服务器那些查询去哪了？</strong></p>\\n<p>本机对本地 <code>DNS</code> 服务器发的是递归查询，后面问根、问 <code>.com</code>、问权威服务器的迭代过程是本地 <code>DNS</code> 服务器替你做的，不在你的抓包范围里。它有缓存的话甚至一次都不用往外问。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>根服务器会存 <code>www.example.com</code> 的 <code>IP</code> 吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会。根服务器只知道 <code>.com</code> 归哪些服务器管，<code>.com</code> 服务器只知道 <code>example.com</code> 的权威服务器是谁，<code>IP</code> 记录最后由权威服务器给出。每一级返回的都是「去问谁」。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>改了 <code>api.example.com</code> 的解析，部分用户还在访问旧 <code>IP</code>，怎么办？</strong></p>\\n<p>旧记录还在各级缓存里，要等 <code>TTL</code> 过期，有些运营商还不按 <code>TTL</code> 来，缓存得更久。所以切换前要提前把 <code>TTL</code> 调到几分钟，切完旧机器多留一段时间，别马上下线。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>页面有二十个第三方域名，全部加 <code>dns-prefetch</code> 好吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>先看数据，<code>Network</code> 面板的 <code>Timing</code> 里看 <code>DNS Lookup</code> 实际花了多久，命中缓存的话几乎是 <code>0</code>。只给首屏关键、确定会用到的几个加，其余靠收敛域名解决。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>移动端用户反馈页面偶尔被插广告，和 <code>DNS</code> 有关系吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>可能是 <code>DNS</code> 劫持，也可能是 <code>HTTP</code> 明文内容被运营商篡改。全站 <code>HTTPS</code> 能挡住篡改，被劫持也只会证书报错，不会显示广告；<code>App</code> 里可以用 <code>HTTPDNS</code>，直接通过 <code>HTTP</code> 接口向云厂商的解析服务要 <code>IP</code>，绕开运营商 <code>DNS</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h2 id=\\"二、数据结构\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#二、数据结构\\">#</a> 二、数据结构</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>前端高频四种：数组（按下标访问 <code>O(1)</code>）、链表（已知节点增删 <code>O(1)</code>、查找 <code>O(n)</code>）、哈希表（<code>Map</code> / <code>Set</code>，平均 <code>O(1)</code> 查找）、树（<code>DOM</code>、<code>Fiber</code>、菜单）</li>\\n<li>选结构看最频繁的操作：按位置访问用数组，按键查、判断存在、去重用 <code>Map</code> / <code>Set</code></li>\\n<li>循环里的 <code>arr.includes</code> 是 <code>O(n)</code>，换成 <code>Set.has</code> 平均 <code>O(1)</code></li>\\n<li>对象去重用 <code>Map</code> 按业务键，<code>Set</code> 比的是引用</li>\\n<li><code>Fiber</code> 把递归遍历改成链表 + 循环，才能中断恢复；递归太深会爆栈，改显式栈</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>数据结构选什么，看你最频繁做的是哪种操作。</strong> 按位置读写用数组，频繁按键查找或判断有没有就上 <code>Map</code>、<code>Set</code>，层级数据就是树。前端最常见的一个优化，就是把循环里的 <code>arr.includes</code> 换成 <code>Set.has</code>，从每次扫一遍变成直接命中。还有个经典例子是 <code>React</code> 的 <code>Fiber</code>：把组件树改成带 <code>child</code>、<code>sibling</code>、<code>return</code> 指针的链表，用循环代替递归，渲染才能随时暂停、随时恢复，数据结构直接决定了能力边界。</p>\\n</section>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>权限页几百个按钮，每个都 <code>allowList.includes(code)</code>，要改吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>看规模。权限码上千、按钮几百，就是几十万次比较，换成 <code>const allow = new Set(allowList)</code> 再 <code>allow.has(code)</code> 几乎零成本，改。只有十几个权限码的话 <code>includes</code> 完全没问题，不用折腾。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把对象放进 <code>Set</code> 去重，字段一样的两个对象还在，为什么？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>Set</code> 对对象比的是引用，内容一样但不是同一个对象就算两个。按业务键去重：<code>[...new Map(list.map(i =&gt; [i.id, i])).values()]</code>，同 <code>id</code> 的后一个会覆盖前一个。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>菜单树每次交互都要按 <code>id</code> 找节点几百次，怎么优化？</strong></p>\\n<p>初始化时遍历一遍，建一个 <code>id → node</code> 的 <code>Map</code> 索引，之后 <code>O(1)</code> 直接拿。代价是菜单增删改时要同步维护索引，菜单整体替换就重建一次。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>递归遍历很深的树报 <code>Maximum call stack size exceeded</code>，怎么改？</strong></p>\\n<p>改成显式栈：<code>const stack = [root]; while (stack.length) { const n = stack.pop(); stack.push(...[...n.children].reverse()) }</code>。进度存在自己的数组里，不吃调用栈，还能随时停下来下次接着跑；<code>reverse</code> 是为了让子节点还按从左到右处理。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>有人提议项目里的数组都换成 <code>Map</code>，你怎么看？</strong></p>\\n<p>不同意。数组有顺序，能直接 <code>map</code>、<code>filter</code>，能直接序列化成 <code>JSON</code>，<code>Map</code> 都要额外处理。只有「按键频繁查找」的热点才值得建索引，通常是数组和 <code>Map</code> 并存，数组管顺序，<code>Map</code> 管查找。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_2-1-栈\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_2-1-栈\\">#</a> 2.1 栈</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>只在一端进出，后进先出（<code>LIFO</code>）；<code>JS</code> 里数组的 <code>push</code> / <code>pop</code> 就是现成的栈，都是 <code>O(1)</code></li>\\n<li>和队列的区别在出口：同一端进出是栈，一头进一头出是队列（数组 <code>shift</code> 是 <code>O(n)</code>）</li>\\n<li>应用：括号匹配、撤销重做、浏览器前进后退、函数调用栈、<code>DFS</code></li>\\n<li>括号匹配两个易错点：遇到右括号时栈为空要直接判错；遍历完栈不空也是错</li>\\n<li>示例 <code>Stack</code> 的 <code>pop()</code> 没有 <code>return</code>，拿不到弹出的值</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>栈就是一摞盘子：最后放上去的最先拿走，也就是后进先出。</strong> <code>JS</code> 里不用自己造，数组的 <code>push</code> 和 <code>pop</code> 都在尾部操作，天然就是一个栈。最经典的应用是括号匹配：遇到左括号压栈，遇到右括号弹出栈顶看能不能配对。这题最容易漏两个边界，一个是右括号来了但栈是空的，另一个是遍历完了栈里还剩左括号，两种都要返回 <code>false</code>。撤销、浏览器后退、函数调用栈也都是同一个道理。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>概念</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>栈是一个线性结构，在计算机中是一个相当常见的数据结构。</li>\\n<li>栈的特点是只能在某一端添加或删除数据，遵循先进后出的原则</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://s.poetries.top/gitee/2020/09/231.png\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<p><strong>实现</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>每种数据结构都可以用很多种方式来实现，其实可以把栈看成是数组的一个子集，所以这里使用数组来实现</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">class</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Stack</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">constructor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>stack <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">item</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>item<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">pop</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">pop</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">peek</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">getCount</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">getCount</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">isEmpty</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">getCount</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">===</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p><strong>应用</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>匹配括号，可以通过栈的特性来完成</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">isValid</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">s</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> map <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token string-property property\\">\'(\'</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token string-property property\\">\')\'</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token string-property property\\">\'[\'</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token string-property property\\">\']\'</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token string-property property\\">\'{\'</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span><span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token string-property property\\">\'}\'</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">3</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> stack <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> s<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>map<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>s<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>s<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> last <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">pop</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>map<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>last<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> map<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>s<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">!=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token boolean\\">false</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token boolean\\">false</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token boolean\\">true</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>有人用 <code>push()</code> 入栈、<code>shift()</code> 出栈，说反正都能取出来，对吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不对，那是队列。<code>push(1)</code>、<code>push(2)</code>、<code>push(3)</code> 之后 <code>shift()</code> 拿到的是 <code>1</code>，栈应该拿到 <code>3</code>。撤销功能写成这样，点一次撤销就回到了最早的状态。而且 <code>shift()</code> 要挪动整个数组，是 <code>O(n)</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>示例 <code>Stack</code> 类调用 <code>pop()</code> 拿到的是 <code>undefined</code>，为什么？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>pop() { this.stack.pop() }</code> 少了 <code>return</code>，元素删了但值没传出来，改成 <code>return this.stack.pop()</code>。括号匹配这种要拿弹出值做判断的场景，这个漏写会让结果全错。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>括号校验函数对 <code>&quot;((&quot;</code> 返回了 <code>true</code>，漏了什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>漏了遍历结束后的栈空判断，剩下的左括号没人配对，应该返回 <code>false</code>，示例里最后那句 <code>if (stack.length &gt; 0) return false</code> 就是干这个的。另一个边界是 <code>&quot;))&quot;</code>：空栈 <code>pop()</code> 得到 <code>undefined</code>，示例靠 <code>NaN != 0</code> 碰巧返回了 <code>false</code>，最好显式判断栈空。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>编辑器撤销之后又输入了新内容，重做栈要怎么处理？</strong></p>\\n<p>清空。用两个栈：撤销时从 <code>undoStack</code> 弹出压进 <code>redoStack</code>，重做反过来；一旦有新操作，<code>redoStack</code> 直接清空，不然重做会跳到一条已经被覆盖的历史上。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>递归处理几万层嵌套数据爆栈了，怎么用栈改写？</strong></p>\\n<p>自己维护一个数组当调用栈，<code>while (stack.length)</code> 里 <code>pop</code> 一个处理，再把子节点压进去。要保持原来从左到右的顺序，子节点得倒序压栈，因为后压的先出。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_2-2-队列\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_2-2-队列\\">#</a> 2.2 队列</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>一头进一头出，先进先出（<code>FIFO</code>），像食堂排队：先来的先打饭</li>\\n<li>数组 <code>push</code> 入队 + <code>shift</code> 出队能用，但 <code>shift</code> 要把后面的元素整体前移，理论上是 <code>O(n)</code></li>\\n<li>量大时用「头指针」：<code>head</code> 下标往后走，不搬数据，出队 <code>O(1)</code>；循环队列再用取模复用前面空出来的格子</li>\\n<li>循环队列的三个坑：空和满怎么区分（留一个空槽或单独记 <code>size</code>）、扩容要按逻辑顺序复制、缩容别太勤</li>\\n<li>前端到处是队列：事件循环的任务队列、<code>Vue</code> 的更新队列、请求并发池、埋点缓冲；广度优先遍历也靠它</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>队列就是排队，先进来的先出去，一端加、另一端取。</strong> 最省事的写法是数组 <code>push</code> 加 <code>shift</code>，几百条数据完全没问题。但 <code>shift</code> 每次要把后面的元素往前挪，积压到几万条时就会变成主线程上的隐形开销。我一般会换成记一个 <code>head</code> 下标的写法，出队只是 <code>head++</code>，不搬数据；要省内存就做成循环队列，用 <code>(i + 1) % capacity</code> 让下标绕回去，代价是空、满、扩容这几个边界要自己处理干净。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>概念</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>队列一个线性结构，特点是在某一端添加数据，在另一端删除数据，遵循先进先出的原则</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://s.poetries.top/gitee/2020/09/232.png\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<p><strong>实现</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>这里会讲解两种实现队列的方式，分别是单链队列和循环队列</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>单链队列</strong></li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">class</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Queue</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">constructor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">enQueue</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">item</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>item<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">deQueue</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">shift</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">getHeader</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">getLength</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">isEmpty</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">getLength</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">===</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>因为单链队列在出队操作的时候需要 <code>O(n)</code> 的时间复杂度，所以引入了循环队列。循环队列的出队操作平均是 <code>O(1)</code> 的时间复杂度</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>循环队列</strong></li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">class</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">SqQueue</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">constructor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">length</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 队头</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>first <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 队尾</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>last <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 当前队列大小</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">enQueue</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">item</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 判断队尾 + 1 是否为队头</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 如果是就代表需要扩容数组</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// % this.queue.length 是为了防止数组越界</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>first <span class=\\"token operator\\">===</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>last <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">%</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resize</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">getLength</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">*</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>last<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> item\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>last <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>last <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">%</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">deQueue</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">isEmpty</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">Error</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'Queue is empty\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> r <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>first<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>first<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">null</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>first <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>first <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">%</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 判断当前队列大小是否过小</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 为了保证不浪费空间，在队列空间等于总长度四分之一时</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 且不为 2 时缩小总长度为当前的一半</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size <span class=\\"token operator\\">===</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">getLength</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">4</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">getLength</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">!==</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resize</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">getLength</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> r\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">getHeader</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">isEmpty</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">Error</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'Queue is empty\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>first<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">getLength</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">isEmpty</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>first <span class=\\"token operator\\">===</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>last\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">resize</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">length</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> q <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      q<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>i <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>first<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">%</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>queue <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> q\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>first <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>last <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>缓冲区用 <code>push</code> 入队、<code>pop</code> 出队，压了 <code>A</code>、<code>B</code>、<code>C</code> 先处理的是 <code>C</code>，有问题吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>有，这已经是栈不是队列了。<code>push</code> 和 <code>pop</code> 都在尾部操作，顺序反过来，埋点、请求这类有时序要求的数据会乱。要从头部取：<code>queue.shift()</code> 或者用 <code>head</code> 下标。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>页面积压了几万条埋点，消费时一直 <code>shift()</code>，<code>Performance</code> 里出现长任务，怎么改？</strong></p>\\n<p>别让数组搬家。最简单的是记一个下标：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">class</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Queue</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  items <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> head <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">enqueue</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">x</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>items<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">dequeue</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> x <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>items<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>head<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 前面空出一半时整体清理一次，避免数组无限变长</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>head <span class=\\"token operator\\">*</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>items<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>items <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>items<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">slice</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>head<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>head <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> x\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>均摊下来每次出队 <code>O(1)</code>，再配合分批消费，一帧只处理几百条。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>循环队列里 <code>first === last</code> 到底是空还是满？</strong></p>\\n<p>如果不处理就分不清。常见做法是底层数组开 <code>capacity + 1</code> 留一个空槽：<code>first === last</code> 是空，<code>(last + 1) % length === first</code> 是满。另一种是单独维护 <code>size</code>，判断更直观，多一个变量而已。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>循环队列扩容后元素顺序乱了，该查哪段？</strong></p>\\n<p>查复制逻辑。队头可能已经绕到数组中间，不能按物理下标 <code>0..n</code> 直接拷，要按 <code>old[(first + i) % oldLength]</code> 逐个搬到新数组，搬完把 <code>first</code> 置 <code>0</code>、<code>last</code> 置 <code>size</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>为什么缩容要等用量降到四分之一才减半，而不是一半？</strong></p>\\n<p>防抖动。如果一半就缩，刚缩完来一个元素又得扩，每次都在复制数组。四分之一才缩到一半，缩完还剩一半空间，留出了缓冲，均摊成本才是 <code>O(1)</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_2-3-链表\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_2-3-链表\\">#</a> 2.3 链表</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>节点 = 值 + <code>next</code> 指针，内存不连续，像寻宝游戏：每张纸条告诉你下一张在哪</li>\\n<li>已经拿到前驱节点时，增删 <code>O(1)</code>，只改指针；按下标或按值找节点是 <code>O(n)</code>，没有随机访问</li>\\n<li>「链表插入 <code>O(1)</code>」只算改指针那一步，算上找位置还是 <code>O(n)</code></li>\\n<li>虚拟头节点 <code>dummyNode</code> 让头部和中间的增删写法统一，少一堆判空</li>\\n<li>改指针顺序：先 <code>node.next = prev.next</code>，再 <code>prev.next = node</code>，反了后半截就丢了</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>链表是一串用指针连起来的节点，每个节点只知道下一个是谁。</strong> 它的好处是不要求内存连续，插入删除不用像数组那样挪后面所有元素，拿到前驱节点就是 <code>O(1)</code>。代价是没有下标，想访问第 <code>k</code> 个只能从头一个个走，而且每个节点多存一个指针。所以面试里有人说「链表插入永远是 <code>O(1)</code>」，我会追一句：位置是谁找的？前端里最典型的例子是 <code>React</code> 的 <code>Fiber</code>，用 <code>child</code>、<code>sibling</code>、<code>return</code> 三个指针把树串起来，遍历可以随时停下、下次接着走。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>概念</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>链表是一个线性结构，同时也是一个天然的递归结构。链表结构可以充分利用计算机内存空间，实现灵活的内存动态管理。但是链表失去了数组随机读取的优点，同时链表由于增加了结点的指针域，空间开销比较大</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://s.poetries.top/gitee/2020/09/233.png\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<p><strong>实现</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>单向链表</strong></li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">class</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Node</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">constructor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> next</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> v\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>next <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> next\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">class</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">LinkList</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">constructor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 链表长度</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 虚拟头部</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>dummyNode <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Node</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">null</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">null</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">find</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">header<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> currentIndex</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>index <span class=\\"token operator\\">===</span> currentIndex<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> header\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">find</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>header<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>next<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> currentIndex <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">addNode</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> index</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">checkIndex</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 当往链表末尾插入时，prev.next 为空</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 其他情况时，因为要插入节点，所以插入的节点</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 的 next 应该是 prev.next</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 然后设置 prev.next 为插入的节点</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> prev <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">find</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>dummyNode<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    prev<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>next <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Node</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> prev<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>next<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> prev<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>next\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">insertNode</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> index</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">addNode</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">addToFirst</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">v</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">addNode</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">addToLast</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">v</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">addNode</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">removeNode</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> isLast</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">checkIndex</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    index <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> isLast <span class=\\"token operator\\">?</span> index <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> index\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> prev <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">find</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>dummyNode<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> node <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> prev<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>next\\n    prev<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>next <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>next\\n    node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>next <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">null</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">removeFirstNode</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">removeNode</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">removeLastNode</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">removeNode</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token boolean\\">true</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">checkIndex</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">index</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>index <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">||</span> index <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">Error</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'Index error\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">getNode</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">index</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">checkIndex</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">isEmpty</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">find</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>dummyNode<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>next\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">isEmpty</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size <span class=\\"token operator\\">===</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">getSize</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>十万个节点的链表，要在下标 <code>50000</code> 插入，复杂度是多少？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>O(n)</code>。改指针确实是常数时间，但得先从头走五万步找到前驱。只有调用方手里已经拿着前驱节点时，插入才真是 <code>O(1)</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>用示例里的 <code>addToLast</code> 连续追加十万项，会怎样？</strong></p>\\n<p>每次尾插都要从 <code>dummyNode</code> 走到末尾，累计接近 <code>O(n²)</code>。而且示例的 <code>find</code> 是递归写的，链表一长还可能直接栈溢出。加一个 <code>tail</code> 指针，尾插就是 <code>tail.next = node; tail = node</code>，<code>O(1)</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>单向链表只给了要删的节点本身，能 <code>O(1)</code> 删掉吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>一般不行，拿不到前驱就改不了 <code>prev.next</code>。有个取巧办法是把后继的值拷过来再删后继：<code>node.value = node.next.value; node.next = node.next.next</code>，但删尾节点时没法用，而且外面持有后继引用的地方会出问题。真要频繁按节点删，就用双向链表。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>删掉的节点为什么要写一句 <code>node.next = null</code>？</strong></p>\\n<p>断开它和原链表的联系。不断的话，外面拿到这个节点还能顺着 <code>next</code> 走进链表内部，误改数据；它也会一直引用着后面的节点，影响回收判断。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>读很多、增删很少的列表数据，有人坚持用链表，你怎么看？</strong></p>\\n<p>不同意。读多写少正是数组的主场：下标访问 <code>O(1)</code>，内存连续对 <code>CPU</code> 缓存也友好。链表的优势只在频繁增删、并且手里已经拿着相邻节点的场景，比如 <code>LRU</code> 缓存里配合 <code>Map</code> 用的双向链表。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_2-4-树\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_2-4-树\\">#</a> 2.4 树</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>二叉树：每个节点最多左右两个孩子，天然递归，处理时基本都是「处理当前节点 + 递归左右」</li>\\n<li>二分搜索树（<code>BST</code>）：左边都比根小、右边都比根大，每比较一次砍掉一半，平均 <code>O(log n)</code></li>\\n<li><code>BST</code> 会退化：有序数据依次插入就成了一条链，查找掉回 <code>O(n)</code>，所以才有 <code>AVL</code>、红黑树</li>\\n<li>中序遍历 <code>BST</code> 天然升序；先序、中序、后序是深度遍历，层序要用队列</li>\\n<li>删除有两个孩子的节点：用右子树最小值（后继）顶上，再把后继从右子树删掉</li>\\n<li>前端里的树：<code>DOM</code>、<code>Fiber</code>、路由表、菜单、<code>AST</code>；层级不可控时递归要防栈溢出</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>二分搜索树就是加了一条规矩的二叉树：左边都比根小，右边都比根大。</strong> 这条规矩让查找像猜数字，每次比较完只用往一边走，树比较平衡时是 <code>O(log n)</code>。但它不会自己保持平衡，比如按递增顺序插入 <code>1、2、3、4</code>，每个新节点都挂在右边，最后就是一条链，跟遍历数组没区别，这就是红黑树这些自平衡结构存在的原因。另外一个常考点是中序遍历「左、根、右」，对 <code>BST</code> 来说输出就是升序，可以拿来校验一棵树是不是合法的 <code>BST</code>。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>二叉树</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>树拥有很多种结构，二叉树是树中最常用的结构，同时也是一个天然的递归结构。</li>\\n<li>二叉树拥有一个根节点，每个节点至多拥有两个子节点，分别为：左节点和右节点。树的最底部节点称之为叶节点，当一颗树的叶数量数量为满时，该树可以称之为满二叉树</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://s.poetries.top/gitee/2020/09/234.png\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<p><strong>二分搜索树</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>二分搜索树也是二叉树，拥有二叉树的特性。但是区别在于二分搜索树每个节点的值都比他的左子树的值大，比右子树的值小</li>\\n<li>这种存储方式很适合于数据搜索。如下图所示，当需要查找 6 的时候，因为需要查找的值比根节点的值大，所以只需要在根节点的右子树上寻找，大大提高了搜索效率</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://s.poetries.top/gitee/2020/09/235.png\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>实现</strong></li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>class Node {\\n  constructor(value) {\\n    this.value = value\\n    this.left = null\\n    this.right = null\\n  }\\n}\\nclass BST {\\n  constructor() {\\n    this.root = null\\n    this.size = 0\\n  }\\n  getSize() {\\n    return this.size\\n  }\\n  isEmpty() {\\n    return this.size === 0\\n  }\\n  addNode(v) {\\n    this.root = this._addChild(this.root, v)\\n  }\\n  // 添加节点时，需要比较添加的节点值和当前\\n  // 节点值的大小\\n  _addChild(node, v) {\\n    if (!node) {\\n      this.size++\\n      return new Node(v)\\n    }\\n    if (node.value &gt; v) {\\n      node.left = this._addChild(node.left, v)\\n    } else if (node.value &lt; v) {\\n      node.right = this._addChild(node.right, v)\\n    }\\n    return node\\n  }\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>以上是最基本的二分搜索树实现，接下来实现树的遍历。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>对于树的遍历来说，有三种遍历方法，分别是先序遍历、中序遍历、后序遍历。三种遍历的区别在于何时访问节点。在遍历树的过程中，每个节点都会遍历三次，分别是遍历到自己，遍历左子树和遍历右子树。如果需要实现先序遍历，那么只需要第一次遍历到节点时进行操作即可</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token comment\\">// 先序遍历可用于打印树的结构</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 先序遍历先访问根节点，然后访问左节点，最后访问右节点。</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">preTraversal</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_pre</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">_pre</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">node</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_pre</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_pre</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 中序遍历可用于排序</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 对于 BST 来说，中序遍历可以实现一次遍历就</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 得到有序的值</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 中序遍历表示先访问左节点，然后访问根节点，最后访问右节点。</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">midTraversal</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_mid</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">_mid</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">node</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_mid</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_mid</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 后序遍历可用于先操作子节点</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 再操作父节点的场景</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 后序遍历表示先访问左节点，然后访问右节点，最后访问根节点。</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">backTraversal</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_back</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">_back</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">node</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_back</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_back</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>以上的这几种遍历都可以称之为深度遍历，对应的还有种遍历叫做广度遍历，也就是一层层地遍历树。对于广度遍历来说，我们需要利用之前讲过的队列结构来完成</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token function\\">breadthTraversal</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">null</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> q <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Queue</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 将根节点入队</span>\\n  q<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">enQueue</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 循环判断队列是否为空，为空</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 代表树遍历完毕</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>q<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">isEmpty</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 将队首出队，判断是否有左右子树</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 有的话，就先左后右入队</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> n <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> q<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">deQueue</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> q<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">enQueue</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> q<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">enQueue</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>接下来先介绍如何在树中寻找最小值或最大数。因为二分搜索树的特性，所以最小值一定在根节点的最左边，最大值相反</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token function\\">getMin</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_getMin</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">_getMin</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">node</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_getMin</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">getMax</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_getMax</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">_getMax</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">node</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_getMin</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>向上取整和向下取整，这两个操作是相反的，所以代码也是类似的，这里只介绍如何向下取整。既然是向下取整，那么根据二分搜索树的特性，值一定在根节点的左侧。只需要一直遍历左子树直到当前节点的值不再大于等于需要的值，然后判断节点是否还拥有右子树。如果有的话，继续上面的递归判断</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token function\\">floor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">v</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> node <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_floor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node <span class=\\"token operator\\">?</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value <span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">null</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">_floor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> v</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">null</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value <span class=\\"token operator\\">===</span> v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> v\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 如果当前节点值还比需要的值大，就继续递归</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_floor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 判断当前节点是否拥有右子树</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> right <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_floor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> right\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>排名，这是用于获取给定值的排名或者排名第几的节点的值，这两个操作也是相反的，所以这个只介绍如何获取排名第几的节点的值。对于这个操作而言，我们需要略微的改造点代码，让每个节点拥有一个 size 属性。该属性表示该节点下有多少子节点（包含自身）</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">class</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Node</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">constructor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">value</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> value\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">null</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">null</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 修改代码</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 新增代码</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">_getSize</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">node</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node <span class=\\"token operator\\">?</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size <span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">_addChild</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> v</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Node</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 修改代码</span>\\n    node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span>\\n    node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_addChild</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 修改代码</span>\\n    node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span>\\n    node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_addChild</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">select</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">k</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> node <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_select</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> k<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node <span class=\\"token operator\\">?</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value <span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">null</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">_select</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> k</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">null</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 先获取左子树下有几个节点</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> size <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left <span class=\\"token operator\\">?</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size <span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 判断 size 是否大于 k</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 如果大于 k，代表所需要的节点在左节点</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>size <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> k<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_select</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> k<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 如果小于 k，代表所需要的节点在右节点</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 注意这里需要重新计算 k，减去根节点除了右子树的节点数量</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>size <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> k<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_select</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> k <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> size <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>接下来讲解的是二分搜索树中最难实现的部分：删除节点。因为对于删除节点来说，会存在以下几种情况</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<ul>\\n<li>需要删除的节点没有子树</li>\\n<li>需要删除的节点只有一条子树</li>\\n<li>需要删除的节点有左右两条树</li>\\n<li>对于前两种情况很好解决，但是第三种情况就有难度了，所以先来实现相对简单的操作：删除最小节点，对于删除最小节点来说，是不存在第三种情况的，删除最大节点操作是和删除最小节点相反的，所以这里也就不再赘述</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token function\\">delectMin</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>root <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_delectMin</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">_delectMin</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">node</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 一直递归左子树</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 如果左子树为空，就判断节点是否拥有右子树</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 有右子树的话就把需要删除的节点替换为右子树</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node <span class=\\"token operator\\">!=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">null</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right\\n  node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_delectMin</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 最后需要重新维护下节点的 `size`</span>\\n  node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_getSize</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_getSize</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>最后讲解的就是如何删除任意节点了。对于这个操作，<code>T.Hibbard</code> 在 <code>1962</code>年提出了解决这个难题的办法，也就是如何解决第三种情况。</li>\\n<li>当遇到这种情况时，需要取出当前节点的后继节点（也就是当前节点右子树的最小节点）来替换需要删除的节点。然后将需要删除节点的左子树赋值给后继结点，右子树删除后继结点后赋值给他。</li>\\n<li>你如果对于这个解决办法有疑问的话，可以这样考虑。因为二分搜索树的特性，父节点一定比所有左子节点大，比所有右子节点小。那么当需要删除父节点时，势必需要拿出一个比父节点大的节点来替换父节点。这个节点肯定不存在于左子树，必然存在于右子树。然后又需要保持父节点都是比右子节点小的，那么就可以取出右子树中最小的那个节点来替换父节点</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token function\\">delect</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">v</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>root <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_delect</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">_delect</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> v</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">null</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 寻找的节点比当前节点小，去左子树找</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_delect</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>value <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 寻找的节点比当前节点大，去右子树找</span>\\n    node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_delect</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 进入这个条件说明已经找到节点</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 先判断节点是否拥有拥有左右子树中的一个</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 是的话，将子树返回出去，这里和 `_delectMin` 的操作一样</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 进入这里，代表节点拥有左右子树</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 先取出当前节点的后继结点，也就是取当前节点右子树的最小值</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> min <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_getMin</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 取出最小值后，删除最小值</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 然后把删除节点后的子树赋值给最小值节点</span>\\n    min<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_delectMin</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 左子树不动</span>\\n    min<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left\\n    node <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> min\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 维护 size</span>\\n  node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>size <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_getSize</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_getSize</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把递增的商品编号依次插进 <code>BST</code>，十万条后查询变得很慢，为什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>树退化成链了。递增输入每次都比当前所有节点大，全挂在最右边，树高等于节点数，查找 <code>O(n)</code>。要么换自平衡树，要么插入前打乱顺序；前端场景其实多数用 <code>Map</code> 或排好序的数组加二分就够了。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>要把一棵 <code>BST</code> 导出成升序数组，有人先序遍历再 <code>sort</code>，你怎么改？</strong></p>\\n<p>直接中序遍历，一趟就是有序的，不用再排：<code>inorder(n.left); res.push(n.value); inorder(n.right)</code>。前提是这棵树确实满足 <code>BST</code> 约束，普通二叉树没这个性质。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>目录树数据有时会出现几千层的单支链，递归渲染直接栈溢出，怎么办？</strong></p>\\n<p>把递归改成手动维护的栈，深度就不受调用栈限制了：<code>const stack = [root]; while (stack.length) { const n = stack.pop(); ... stack.push(...n.children.reverse()) }</code>。渲染层面还要配合懒加载或虚拟滚动，几千层一次全渲染本身就有问题。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>删一个左右孩子都有的节点，随便拿右子树里一个节点顶上行不行？</strong></p>\\n<p>不行。顶上去的节点要比整棵左子树大、比剩下的右子树小，只有右子树里最小的那个（后继）满足；左子树最大的那个（前驱）也可以。随便选一个会破坏左小右大的约束。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>节点上维护了 <code>size</code> 用来查排名，删除之后排名全偏了，查哪？</strong></p>\\n<p>查递归回溯时有没有重算 <code>size = size(left) + size(right) + 1</code>。尤其是用后继替换的那条路径，后继被摘掉、新节点接上左右子树之后，沿路所有祖先都要更新，漏一层后面的排名就全错。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_2-5-堆\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_2-5-堆\\">#</a> 2.5 堆</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>堆 = 完全二叉树 + 父子有大小关系；大根堆父节点 <code>&gt;=</code> 子节点，小根堆反过来</li>\\n<li>只管父子，不管兄弟，所以不是全局有序；正因为要求低，增删才能做到 <code>O(log n)</code></li>\\n<li>用数组存，不用指针：左孩子 <code>2i + 1</code>、右孩子 <code>2i + 2</code>、父节点 <code>Math.floor((i - 1) / 2)</code></li>\\n<li>插入：放末尾再 <code>shiftUp</code> 上浮；删堆顶：末尾元素换上来再 <code>shiftDown</code> 下沉；看堆顶 <code>O(1)</code></li>\\n<li>典型用途：优先队列、<code>Top K</code>（前 <code>k</code> 大用大小为 <code>k</code> 的小根堆）、定时器调度；<code>React</code> 的 <code>Scheduler</code> 就用小根堆按过期时间排任务</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>堆就是一棵用数组存的完全二叉树，只保证父节点比孩子大（或小），所以堆顶永远是最大值（或最小值）。</strong> 可以把它想成公司层级，只要求领导比直属下属厉害，同级之间不排名。正因为不要求全部有序，加一个元素只需要沿着树往上比较、交换，最多走树高那么多步，<code>O(log n)</code>；删掉堆顶就把最后一个元素提上来往下沉。所以要「反复取最大值」又不断有新元素进来时，堆比每次全量排序划算得多。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>概念</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>堆通常是一个可以被看做一棵树的数组对象。</li>\\n<li>堆的实现通过构造二叉堆，实为二叉树的一种。这种数据结构具有以下性质。</li>\\n<li>任意节点小于（或大于）它的所有子节点\\n堆总是一棵完全树。即除了最底层，其他层的节点都被元素填满，且最底层从左到右填入。</li>\\n<li>将根节点最大的堆叫做最大堆或大根堆，根节点最小的堆叫做最小堆或小根堆。</li>\\n<li>优先队列也完全可以用堆来实现，操作是一模一样的。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>实现大根堆</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>堆的每个节点的左边子节点索引是 <code>i * 2 + 1</code>，右边是 <code>i * 2 + 2</code>，父节点是 <code>(i - 1) /2</code>。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<ul>\\n<li>堆有两个核心的操作，分别是 <code>shiftUp</code> 和 <code>shiftDown</code> 。前者用于添加元素，后者用于删除根节点。</li>\\n<li><code>shiftUp</code> 的核心思路是一路将节点与父节点对比大小，如果比父节点大，就和父节点交换位置。</li>\\n<li><code>shiftDown</code> 的核心思路是先将根节点和末尾交换位置，然后移除末尾元素。接下来循环判断父节点和两个子节点的大小，如果子节点大，就把最大的子节点和父节点交换</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://s.poetries.top/gitee/2020/09/236.png\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">class</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">MaxHeap</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">constructor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>heap <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">size</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>heap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">empty</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">size</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">==</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">add</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">item</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>heap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>item<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_shiftUp</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">size</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">removeMax</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_shiftDown</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">getParentIndex</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">k</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">parseInt</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>k <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">getLeftIndex</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">k</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> k <span class=\\"token operator\\">*</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">_shiftUp</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">k</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 如果当前节点比父节点大，就交换</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>heap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>k<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>heap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">getParentIndex</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>k<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_swap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>k<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">getParentIndex</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>k<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 将索引变成父节点</span>\\n      k <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">getParentIndex</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>k<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">_shiftDown</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">k</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 交换首位并删除末尾</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_swap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>k<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">size</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>heap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">splice</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">size</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 判断节点是否有左孩子，因为二叉堆的特性，有右必有左</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">getLeftIndex</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>k<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">size</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">getLeftIndex</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>k<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 判断是否有右孩子，并且右孩子是否大于左孩子</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">size</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>heap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>heap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> j<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 判断父节点是否已经比子节点都大</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>heap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>k<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>heap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">break</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">_swap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>k<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n      k <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> j\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">_swap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> right</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> rightValue <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>heap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>heap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>heap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>heap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> rightValue\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>大根堆数组第一个是最大值，那整个数组是不是降序的？</strong></p>\\n<p>不是。比如 <code>[9, 5, 8, 1, 2]</code> 就是个合法大根堆，<code>5</code> 后面跟着 <code>8</code>。堆只保证父比子大，兄弟和不同子树之间没顺序。要完整排序得一个个取堆顶，这就是堆排序。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>十万条数据取前 <code>10</code> 大，用大根堆还是小根堆？</strong></p>\\n<p>小根堆，容量固定 <code>10</code>。新来的数比堆顶大就替换堆顶再下沉，比堆顶小直接丢掉。最后堆里就是前 <code>10</code> 大，复杂度 <code>O(n log k)</code>，比全量排序 <code>O(n log n)</code> 快，内存也只占 <code>k</code> 个位置。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把「取最高分」改成「取最低分」，只把 <code>removeMax</code> 改名 <code>removeMin</code> 行吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不行，名字改了逻辑没改。<code>shiftUp</code> 里比较方向要反过来，<code>shiftDown</code> 里要选两个孩子中更小的那个交换。更好的写法是传一个比较函数进来：<code>new Heap((a, b) =&gt; a - b)</code>，大小堆共用一套代码。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>删完堆顶后新的根不是最大值，<code>shiftDown</code> 里先查什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>先查是不是只跟左孩子比了。下沉时要先在左右孩子里挑大的：<code>if (j + 1 &lt; size &amp;&amp; heap[j + 1] &gt; heap[j]) j++</code>，再拿它和父节点比。漏掉右孩子，右边更大的值就会留在下面。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>有人想用对象节点加 <code>left</code>、<code>right</code> 指针来实现堆，你怎么看？</strong></p>\\n<p>没必要。堆一定是完全二叉树，数组存放没有空洞，下标公式就能算出父子关系，省掉指针内存，访问也更快。对象树只有在需要合并堆之类的特殊操作时才考虑。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h2 id=\\"三、算法\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#三、算法\\">#</a> 三、算法</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>前端考算法看的是「复杂度意识」：一眼看出嵌套循环是 <code>O(n²)</code>，知道数据涨十倍会不会崩</li>\\n<li>高频四类：排序与查找（二分、双指针）、递归与树遍历、链表与栈队列、少量动态规划</li>\\n<li>和业务挂钩的点：虚拟列表二分定位、树形数据扁平化与还原、<code>diff</code> 里的最长递增子序列、<code>LRU</code> 缓存</li>\\n<li>递归处理树要防栈溢出，深度不可控就改显式栈；耗时长的计算要分片，别卡主线程</li>\\n<li>答题顺序：先说思路和复杂度 → 再写代码 → 最后补边界（空输入、重复值、超大数据）</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>前端面试里的算法，重点不是背多少题，而是能不能判断一段代码在数据变大之后会不会出问题。</strong> 比如列表里每一项都去另一个数组 <code>includes</code> 一遍，几百条看不出来，几万条就是几亿次比较。日常最常用到的其实就几样：用 <code>Map</code> 把查找从 <code>O(n)</code> 降到 <code>O(1)</code>，有序数据上二分，树形数据递归或用栈迭代。面试写题时我会先把思路和复杂度讲清楚再动手，写完主动补空数组、重复元素这些边界，比闷头写出来更加分。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p>下面几节分别讲复杂度、位运算、排序、链表和树。先看一个前端最常遇到的复杂度问题，以及怎么改。</p>\\n<p>最常见的坑是循环里套查找：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token comment\\">// O(n * m)：每个订单都去用户数组里找一遍</span>\\norders<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">map</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">o</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">...</span>o<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token literal-property property\\">user</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> users<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">find</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">u</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> u<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>id <span class=\\"token operator\\">===</span> o<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>userId<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// O(n + m)：先建一个 Map，查找变成 O(1)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> userMap <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Map</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>users<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">map</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">u</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>u<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>id<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> u<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\norders<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">map</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">o</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">...</span>o<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token literal-property property\\">user</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> userMap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">get</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>o<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>userId<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>订单和用户各 <code>1</code> 万条时，前者最坏要比较 <code>1</code> 亿次，后者大约 <code>2</code> 万次。</p>\\n<p>另一个常见场景是树形数据。递归写法最直观，但层级深度由后端数据决定，不可控时改用显式栈：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">flatten</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">root</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> res <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> stack <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> node <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">pop</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>id<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 倒序压栈，保证弹出时还是从左到右</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>children<span class=\\"token operator\\">?.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">??</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>children<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> res\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>练题时建议按「数组与哈希 → 双指针与二分 → 栈队列链表 → 树的遍历 → 简单动态规划」的顺序，每类刷到能讲清复杂度再往下走。</p>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>页面只有几百条数据，同事说算法优化没意义，你同意吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>看路径。只跑一次的初始化，几百条随便写；但如果在 <code>render</code>、<code>scroll</code>、<code>input</code> 这种高频路径上，一次 <code>O(n²)</code> 乘上每秒几十次调用就是问题。先量一下真实耗时和调用频率再定，别凭感觉。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>动态高度的虚拟列表，每次滚动都从第一项累加高度找起点，几万项时卡了，怎么改？</strong></p>\\n<p>维护一个前缀和数组 <code>offsets[i]</code> 表示第 <code>i</code> 项的顶部位置，滚动时对它二分找第一个 <code>offsets[i] &gt; scrollTop</code> 的位置，<code>O(log n)</code>。某一项高度变了，只需要更新它后面的前缀和，可以惰性更新到用到的位置。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>搜索框每输入一个字就全量过滤，结果对但页面卡，先改算法还是改触发方式？</strong></p>\\n<p>先拆开看：单次多慢、一秒触发几次。一般先上防抖把触发降下来，再看过滤本身有没有嵌套扫描，能不能预先建索引。防抖只减少次数，单次本身就要 <code>200ms</code> 的话照样卡，那就得放进 <code>Web Worker</code> 或改数据结构。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把扁平数组转成树形菜单，线上偶尔丢节点，复杂度明明是 <code>O(n)</code>，会是什么问题？</strong></p>\\n<p>复杂度说明不了正确性。常见原因是子节点比父节点先出现，或者 <code>parentId</code> 指向不存在的节点、出现重复 <code>id</code>。写法上先遍历一遍建 <code>Map&lt;id, node&gt;</code>，再遍历一遍挂到父节点下，就不怕顺序问题；找不到父节点的要上报而不是悄悄丢掉。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>候选人排序代码默写得很熟，但说不清数据涨十倍会怎样，你怎么评价？</strong></p>\\n<p>背题背得好，工程判断还差点。我更想听到的是「这里是 <code>O(n log n)</code>，十倍数据大概慢十几倍，可以接受」这种判断，以及什么时候该保持简单写法、什么时候值得建索引。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-1-时间复杂度\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-1-时间复杂度\\">#</a> 3.1 时间复杂度</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>复杂度描述的是「数据变多时，耗时怎么涨」，不是具体跑几毫秒</li>\\n<li>只留最高阶、去掉常数：<code>3n + 5</code> 记 <code>O(n)</code>，<code>n² + n</code> 记 <code>O(n²)</code></li>\\n<li>默认看最坏情况；两个同阶算法比快慢，才轮到常数项和实测</li>\\n<li>快速估算：一层循环 <code>O(n)</code>；循环里再 <code>includes</code> / <code>find</code> / <code>indexOf</code> 就是 <code>O(n²)</code>；二分 <code>O(log n)</code>；<code>sort</code> 是 <code>O(n log n)</code></li>\\n<li>空间也要算：递归栈深度、链式 <code>map</code> / <code>filter</code> 每步产生的中间数组</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>时间复杂度说的是数据量变大时，执行次数按什么趋势增长，而不是代码具体跑多久。</strong> 打个比方，<code>O(n)</code> 是数据翻倍耗时也翻倍，<code>O(n²)</code> 是数据翻倍耗时变四倍，<code>O(log n)</code> 是数据翻倍只多一步。算的时候只看最高阶，常数和低阶项在数据量大时影响很小，所以 <code>aN + 1</code> 记成 <code>O(N)</code>。前端里最容易踩的是隐藏的嵌套，<code>forEach</code> 里调一个 <code>includes</code>，看起来一层循环，其实是 <code>O(n²)</code>。</p>\\n</section>\\n<ul>\\n<li>通常使用最差的时间复杂度来衡量一个算法的好坏。</li>\\n<li>常数时间 <code>O(1)</code> 代表这个操作和数据量没关系，是一个固定时间的操作，比如说四则运算。</li>\\n<li>对于一个算法来说，可能会计算出如下操作次数 <code>aN +</code>1，<code>N</code> 代表数据量。那么该算法的时间复杂度就是 <code>O(N)</code>。因为我们在计算时间复杂度的时候，数据量通常是非常大的，这时候低阶项和常数项可以忽略不计。</li>\\n<li>当然可能会出现两个算法都是 <code>O(N)</code> 的时间复杂度，那么对比两个算法的好坏就要通过对比低阶项和常数项了</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>用代码把常见的几档复杂度对上号，面试时能一眼认出来：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token comment\\">// O(1)：和数据量无关</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> first <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// O(n)：一层循环</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> x <span class=\\"token keyword\\">of</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> sum <span class=\\"token operator\\">+=</span> x\\n\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// O(n²)：循环里套线性查找，看起来只有一层</span>\\narr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">forEach</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">x</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>other<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">includes</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> hit<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// O(log n)：每次砍掉一半</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">search</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> target</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> l <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> r <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>l <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span> r<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> mid <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>l <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> r<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">>>></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">===</span> target<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> mid\\n    arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> target <span class=\\"token operator\\">?</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>l <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> mid <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>r <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> mid <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// O(n log n)：排序</span>\\narr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">sort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">a<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> b</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> a <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> b<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>为什么要去掉常数和低阶项？假设算法 <code>A</code> 执行 <code>100n</code> 次、算法 <code>B</code> 执行 <code>n²</code> 次。<code>n = 50</code> 时 <code>B</code> 更快（<code>2500</code> 对 <code>5000</code>）；<code>n = 1000</code> 时 <code>A</code> 是 <code>10</code> 万次，<code>B</code> 是 <code>100</code> 万次。数据越大，最高阶越说了算，这就是大 <code>O</code> 只保留最高阶的原因。</p>\\n<p>但数据量小的时候常数确实重要，这也是很多语言的排序在元素很少时改用插入排序的原因。复杂度用来判断「能不能扛住规模增长」，具体快多少还是要实测。</p>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>一段固定循环 <code>100</code> 次的代码，有人标成 <code>O(n)</code>，对吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不对，次数跟输入规模无关，是 <code>O(1)</code>。不过 <code>O(1)</code> 不等于快，循环体里如果每次都做重活，<code>100</code> 次照样能卡，复杂度和实测是两回事。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>list.filter(item =&gt; selected.includes(item.id))</code>，两边都会涨到上万条，这行有什么问题？</strong></p>\\n<p>外层 <code>n</code>，里面 <code>includes</code> 又是线性扫描，两边同阶就是 <code>O(n²)</code>，一万对一万就是上亿次比较。先 <code>const set = new Set(selected)</code>，再用 <code>set.has(item.id)</code>，降到 <code>O(n)</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>页面只有十条数据，有人为了 <code>O(1)</code> 查询加了一套复杂缓存，值得吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不值得。复杂度忽略的常数在小数据下反而占大头，建缓存、维护失效的成本可能比直接遍历十条还高，还多了出问题的地方。等数据真涨起来再换，留好替换点就行。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>发版后接口各种规模都整体慢了一截，复杂度没变，查什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>查常数项。同样是 <code>O(n)</code>，循环体里多了一次 <code>JSON.parse</code>、多了一次深拷贝、多建了对象，都会整体变慢。拿几组不同规模的数据前后对比，如果斜率一样只是整体抬高，就是单次操作变重了。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>arr.sort()</code> 的复杂度是多少？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>V8</code> 用的是 <code>TimSort</code>，平均和最坏都是 <code>O(n log n)</code>，数据本来就基本有序时能接近 <code>O(n)</code>。注意它是原地排序会改原数组，不想改原数组用 <code>toSorted()</code>（<code>ES2023</code>）。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-2-位运算\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-2-位运算\\">#</a> 3.2 位运算</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>移位：<code>a &lt;&lt; b</code> 相当于 <code>a * 2^b</code>；<code>a &gt;&gt; b</code> 相当于 <code>a / 2^b</code> 再向下取整（负数也是向下，<code>-13 &gt;&gt; 1</code> 得 <code>-7</code>）</li>\\n<li>与 <code>&amp;</code> 判断某一位、或 <code>|</code> 打开某一位、<code>&amp; ~</code> 关闭某一位，权限位和状态标记最常用</li>\\n<li>异或 <code>^</code>：相同为 <code>0</code>、不同为 <code>1</code>；<code>a ^ a === 0</code>、<code>a ^ 0 === a</code>，所以成对抵消，能找出只出现一次的数</li>\\n<li>不用加号求和：<code>a ^ b</code> 是不进位的和，<code>(a &amp; b) &lt;&lt; 1</code> 是进位，循环到进位为 <code>0</code></li>\\n<li><code>JS</code> 的坑：位运算先把数转成 <code>32</code> 位有符号整数，超过 <code>2^31 - 1</code> 会溢出变负，时间戳、大 <code>ID</code> 别碰</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>位运算就是直接在二进制位上做加工，常用场景是乘除 <code>2</code> 的幂、用一个整数存多个开关、以及异或抵消。</strong> 比如权限：查看 <code>1</code>、编辑 <code>2</code>、导出 <code>4</code>，一个用户的权限 <code>5</code> 就是二进制 <code>101</code>，查看和导出开着，判断用 <code>flags &amp; 4</code>。异或的特点是同一个数异或两次就没了，所以一堆成对出现的数里找落单的那个，全部异或一遍就行。但在 <code>JS</code> 里要小心，所有位运算都会先截成 <code>32</code> 位有符号整数，<code>2 ** 31 | 0</code> 直接变成负数，拿它处理时间戳就会出问题。</p>\\n</section>\\n<ul>\\n<li>位运算在算法中很有用，速度可以比四则运算快很多。</li>\\n<li>在学习位运算之前应该知道十进制如何转二进制，二进制如何转十进制。这里说明下简单的计算方式</li>\\n<li>十进制 <code>33</code> 可以看成是 <code>32 + 1</code> ，并且 <code>33</code> 应该是六位二进制的（因为 <code>33</code>近似 <code>32</code>，而 <code>32</code> 是 <code>2</code>的五次方，所以是六位），那么 十进制 <code>33</code> 就是 <code>100001</code> ，只要是 2 的次方，那么就是 <code>1</code>否则都为 <code>0</code>\\n那么二进制 <code>100001</code> 同理，首位是 <code>2^5</code>，末位是 <code>2^0</code> ，相加得出 <code>33</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>左移 &lt;&lt;</strong></p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>10 &lt;&lt; 1 // -&gt; 20\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>左移就是将二进制全部往左移动，<code>10</code>在二进制中表示为 <code>1010</code> ，左移一位后变成 <code>10100</code> ，转换为十进制也就是 <code>20</code>，所以基本可以把左移看成以下公式 <code>a * (2 ^ b)</code></p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>算数右移 &gt;&gt;</strong></p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>10 &gt;&gt; 1 // -&gt; 5\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>算数右移就是将二进制全部往右移动并去除多余的右边，10 在二进制中表示为 <code>1010</code> ，右移一位后变成 <code>101</code> ，转换为十进制也就是 <code>5</code>，所以基本可以把右移看成以下公式 <code>int v = a / (2 ^ b)</code></li>\\n<li>右移很好用，比如可以用在二分算法中取中间值</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>13 &gt;&gt; 1 // -&gt; 6\\n</code></pre>\\n<p><strong>按位操作</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>按位与</strong></li>\\n</ul>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>每一位都为 1，结果才为 1</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>8 &amp; 7 // -&gt; 0\\n// 1000 &amp; 0111 -&gt; 0000 -&gt; 0\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>按位或</strong></li>\\n</ul>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>其中一位为 1，结果就是 1</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>8 | 7 // -&gt; 15\\n// 1000 | 0111 -&gt; 1111 -&gt; 15\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>按位异或</strong></li>\\n</ul>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>每一位都不同，结果才为 1</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>8 ^ 7 // -&gt; 15\\n8 ^ 8 // -&gt; 0\\n// 1000 ^ 0111 -&gt; 1111 -&gt; 15\\n// 1000 ^ 1000 -&gt; 0000 -&gt; 0\\n</code></pre>\\n<p><strong>面试题：两个数不使用四则运算得出和</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>这道题中可以按位异或，因为按位异或就是不进位加法，<code>8 ^ 8 = 0</code> 如果进位了，就是 <code>16</code> 了，所以我们只需要将两个数进行异或操作，然后进位。那么也就是说两个二进制都是 1 的位置，左边应该有一个进位 <code>1</code>，所以可以得出以下公式 <code>a + b = (a ^ b) + ((a &amp; b) &lt;&lt; 1)</code> ，然后通过迭代的方式模拟加法</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">sum</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">a<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> b</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>a <span class=\\"token operator\\">==</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> b\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>b <span class=\\"token operator\\">==</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> a\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> newA <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> a <span class=\\"token operator\\">^</span> b\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> newB <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>a <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;</span> b<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">sum</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>newA<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> newB<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>用 <code>score &gt;&gt; 1</code> 算一半分数，<code>13</code> 得到 <code>6</code>，产品说应该是 <code>6.5</code>，哪错了？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>&gt;&gt;</code> 会把移出去的低位直接丢掉，等于整数除法向下取整。要保留小数就老老实实 <code>score / 2</code>。位运算当除法只适合明确要整数的场景，比如二分取中点。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>接口返回权限值 <code>5</code>，怎么判断有没有导出权限，怎么开关？</strong></p>\\n<p>先定义位：<code>VIEW = 1 &lt;&lt; 0</code>、<code>EDIT = 1 &lt;&lt; 1</code>、<code>EXPORT = 1 &lt;&lt; 2</code>。判断 <code>(flags &amp; EXPORT) !== 0</code>，打开 <code>flags | EXPORT</code>，关闭 <code>flags &amp; ~EXPORT</code>。每一位代表什么要前后端写死在文档里，加新权限只能往后加位，不能挪。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>二分里写 <code>(left + right) &gt;&gt; 1</code>，有什么隐患？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>left + right</code> 超过 <code>2^31 - 1</code> 时，<code>&gt;&gt;</code> 会把结果当成负数。前端数组一般到不了这么大，但写成 <code>(left + right) &gt;&gt;&gt; 1</code> 或 <code>left + Math.floor((right - left) / 2)</code> 就没这个顾虑，<code>&gt;&gt;&gt;</code> 是无符号右移。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>数组里每个数都出现两次，只有一个出现一次，怎么 <code>O(1)</code> 空间找出来？</strong></p>\\n<p>全部异或：<code>nums.reduce((a, b) =&gt; a ^ b, 0)</code>。成对的数异或成 <code>0</code>，最后剩下的就是落单的。比如 <code>[4, 1, 2, 1, 2]</code> 结果是 <code>4</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>不用加号的求和函数，负数会不会死循环？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会。<code>JS</code> 里进位 <code>(a &amp; b) &lt;&lt; 1</code> 每轮左移一位，最多 <code>32</code> 轮就移出 <code>32</code> 位变成 <code>0</code>，负数按补码算也能正确收敛。写成循环更稳：<code>while (b) { const c = (a &amp; b) &lt;&lt; 1; a = a ^ b; b = c } return a</code>。只是结果仍受 <code>32</code> 位范围限制。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-3-排序\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-3-排序\\">#</a> 3.3 排序</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>O(n²)</code> 三兄弟：冒泡（相邻比较交换，一轮没交换就提前退出）、选择（每轮挑最小，交换少但不稳定）、插入（像理扑克牌，基本有序时接近 <code>O(n)</code>）</li>\\n<li><code>O(n log n)</code> 两个主力：归并（稳定，分治，要 <code>O(n)</code> 额外空间）、快排（原地，平均最快，最坏 <code>O(n²)</code>）</li>\\n<li>稳定性 = 相等的元素排完后保持原来的先后顺序；多字段排序（先按时间、再按状态）必须稳定</li>\\n<li>快排退化：固定拿首位或末位当基准，遇到已排好的数据就成 <code>O(n²)</code>，所以要随机基准或三数取中</li>\\n<li><code>JS</code> 的 <code>sort</code>：<code>V8 7.0</code>（<code>Chrome 70</code>）起换成 <code>TimSort</code> 保证稳定，<code>ES2019</code> 也写进了规范；默认按字符串比，排数字必须传 <code>(a, b) =&gt; a - b</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>排序算法按复杂度分两档：冒泡、选择、插入是 <code>O(n²)</code>，归并和快排是 <code>O(n log n)</code>。</strong> 插入排序有点像理扑克牌，每拿一张插到已经排好的那堆里，所以数据基本有序时很快，很多语言的排序在小数组上会退回插入排序。归并稳定但要额外数组，快排原地但基准选不好会退化。实际写业务我基本只用 <code>Array.prototype.sort</code>，要注意两点：默认是按字符串比较，<code>[10, 9, 1].sort()</code> 得到 <code>[1, 10, 9]</code>；老版本 <code>V8</code> 对超过 <code>10</code> 个元素用的是不稳定的快排，现在已经稳定了。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>冒泡排序</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>冒泡排序的原理如下，从第一个元素开始，把当前元素和下一个索引元素进行比较。如果当前元素大，那么就交换位置，重复操作直到比较到最后一个元素，那么此时最后一个元素就是该数组中最大的数。下一轮重复以上操作，但是此时最后一个元素已经是最大数了，所以不需要再比较最后一个元素，只需要比较到 <code>length - 1</code> 的位置</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://s.poetries.top/gitee/2020/09/237.png\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>以下是实现该算法的代码</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">bubble</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">checkArray</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 从 0 到 `length - 1` 遍历</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">swap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>该算法的操作次数是一个等差数列 <code>n + (n - 1) + (n - 2) + 1</code> ，去掉常数项以后得出时间复杂度是<code>O(n * n)</code></p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>插入排序</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>入排序的原理如下。第一个元素默认是已排序元素，取出下一个元素和当前元素比较，如果当前元素大就交换位置。那么此时第一个元素就是当前的最小数，所以下次取出操作从第三个元素开始，向前对比，重复之前的操作</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://s.poetries.top/gitee/2020/09/238.png\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<p>以下是实现该算法的代码</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">insertion</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">checkArray</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token function\\">swap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>该算法的操作次数是一个等差数列 <code>n + (n - 1) + (n - 2) + 1</code> ，去掉常数项以后得出时间复杂度是 <code>O(n * n)</code></p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>选择排序</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>选择排序的原理如下。遍历数组，设置最小值的索引为 0，如果取出的值比当前最小值小，就替换最小值索引，遍历完成后，将第一个元素和最小值索引上的值交换。如上操作后，第一个元素就是数组中的最小值，下次遍历就可以从索引 1 开始重复上述操作</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://user-gold-cdn.xitu.io/2018/4/13/162bc8ea14567e2e?w=670&amp;h=508&amp;f=gif&amp;s=965636\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<p>以下是实现该算法的代码</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">selection</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">checkArray</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> minIndex <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      minIndex <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>minIndex<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">?</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> minIndex<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">swap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> minIndex<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>该算法的操作次数是一个等差数列 <code>n + (n - 1) + (n - 2) + 1</code> ，去掉常数项以后得出时间复杂度是 <code>O(n * n)</code></p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>归并排序</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>归并排序的原理如下。递归的将数组两两分开直到最多包含两个元素，然后将数组排序合并，最终合并为排序好的数组。假设我有一组数组 <code>[3, 1, 2, 8, 9, 7, 6]</code>，中间数索引是 3，先排序数组 <code>[3, 1, 2, 8]</code> 。在这个左边数组上，继续拆分直到变成数组包含两个元素（如果数组长度是奇数的话，会有一个拆分数组只包含一个元素）。然后排序数组 <code>[3, 1]</code> 和 <code>[2, 8]</code> ，然后再排序数组 <code>[1, 3, 2, 8]</code> ，这样左边数组就排序完成，然后按照以上思路排序右边数组，最后将数组 <code>[1, 2, 3, 8]</code> 和 <code>[6, 7, 9]</code> 排序</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://user-gold-cdn.xitu.io/2018/4/13/162be13c7e30bd86?w=896&amp;h=1008&amp;f=gif&amp;s=937952\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<p>以下是实现该算法的代码</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">sort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">checkArray</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> right</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 左右索引相同说明已经只有一个数</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>left <span class=\\"token operator\\">===</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 等同于 `left + (right - left) / 2`</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 相比 `(left + right) / 2` 来说更加安全，不会溢出</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 使用位运算是因为位运算比四则运算快</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> mid <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">parseInt</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>left <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>right <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">>></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> mid <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> help <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> p1 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> p2 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> mid <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>p1 <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span> mid <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> p2 <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    help<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>p1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>p2<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">?</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>p1<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>p2<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>p1 <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span> mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    help<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>p1<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>p2 <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    help<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>p2<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> help<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>left <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> help<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>以上算法使用了递归的思想。递归的本质就是压栈，每递归执行一次函数，就将该函数的信息（比如参数，内部的变量，执行到的行数）压栈，直到遇到终止条件，然后出栈并继续执行函数。对于以上递归函数的调用轨迹如下</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>data<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">6</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// mid = 3</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>data<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// mid = 1</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>data<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// mid = 0</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>data<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 遇到终止，回退到上一步</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>data<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 遇到终止，回退到上一步</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 排序 p1 = 0, p2 = mid + 1 = 1</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 回退到 `mergeSort(data, 0, 3)` 执行下一个递归</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// mid = 2</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 遇到终止，回退到上一步</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 排序 p1 = 2, p2 = mid + 1 = 3</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 回退到 `mergeSort(data, 0, 3)` 执行合并逻辑</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 排序 p1 = 0, p2 = mid + 1 = 2</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 执行完毕回退</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 左边数组排序完毕，右边也是如上轨迹</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>该算法的操作次数是可以这样计算：递归了两次，每次数据量是数组的一半，并且最后把整个数组迭代了一次，所以得出表达式 <code>2T(N / 2) + T(N)</code> （<code>T</code> 代表时间，<code>N</code> 代表数据量）。根据该表达式可以套用 该公式 得出时间复杂度为 <code>O(N * logN)</code></p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>快排</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>快排的原理如下。随机选取一个数组中的值作为基准值，从左至右取值与基准值对比大小。比基准值小的放数组左边，大的放右边，对比完成后将基准值和第一个比基准值大的值交换位置。然后将数组以基准值的位置分为两部分，继续递归以上操作。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://user-gold-cdn.xitu.io/2018/4/16/162cd23e69ca9ea3?w=824&amp;h=506&amp;f=gif&amp;s=867744\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<p>以下是实现该算法的代码</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">sort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">checkArray</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">quickSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">quickSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> right</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>left <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">swap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 随机取值，然后和末尾交换，这样做比固定取一个位置的复杂度略低</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> indexs <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">part</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">parseInt</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">random</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">*</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>right <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> left <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">quickSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> indexs<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">quickSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> indexs<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">part</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> right</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> less <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> left <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> more <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>left <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> more<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 当前值比基准值小，`less` 和 `left` 都加一</span>\\n\\t   <span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span>less<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n       <span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 当前值比基准值大，将当前值和右边的值交换</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 并且不改变 `left`，因为当前换过来的值还没有判断过大小</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token function\\">swap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span>more<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 和基准值相同，只移动下标</span>\\n      left<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 将基准值和比基准值大的第一个值交换位置</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 这样数组就变成 `[比基准值小, 基准值, 比基准值大]`</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">swap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> more<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>less<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> more<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>该算法的复杂度和归并排序是相同的，但是额外空间复杂度比归并排序少，只需 <code>O(logN)</code>，并且相比归并排序来说，所需的常数时间也更少</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>面试题</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>Sort Colors：该题目来自 LeetCode，题目需要我们将 <code>[2,0,2,1,1,0]</code> 排序成 <code>[0,0,1,1,2,2]</code>，这个问题就可以使用三路快排的思想</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">sortColors</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">nums</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> left <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> right <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 下标如果遇到 right，说明已经排序完成</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">==</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token function\\">swap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">==</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token function\\">swap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>[10, 9, 1].sort()</code> 结果是什么，为什么？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>[1, 10, 9]</code>。不传比较函数时会把元素转成字符串按 <code>UTF-16</code> 码元比，<code>\'10\'</code> 排在 <code>\'9\'</code> 前面。排数字一定要 <code>arr.sort((a, b) =&gt; a - b)</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>都是 <code>O(n²)</code>，冒泡、选择、插入随便选一个行吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不行，看数据形态。几乎有序的数据，插入排序每个元素只挪一两步，接近 <code>O(n)</code>；选择排序不管数据什么样都要扫完剩余区间，永远 <code>O(n²)</code> 次比较。选择排序的优点只是交换次数最少，并且它不稳定。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>表格先按时间排好，再按状态排序，同状态的行时间顺序乱了，为什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>第二次排序不稳定。在 <code>Chrome 70</code> 之前，<code>V8</code> 的 <code>sort</code> 对超过 <code>10</code> 个元素用快排，不保证相等元素的相对顺序。现在主流浏览器都稳定了；要兼容很老的环境，就写一个比较函数一次比两个字段：<code>(a, b) =&gt; a.status - b.status || a.time - b.time</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>快排处理已经排好序的十万条数据特别慢，原因是什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>基准选了首位或末位，每次分区一边是空的，另一边是 <code>n - 1</code> 个，退化成 <code>O(n²)</code>，递归深度也到 <code>n</code>，可能直接栈溢出。随机选基准或者三数取中就能避开。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>归并合并时写成 <code>left[i] &lt; right[j]</code>，有什么问题？</strong></p>\\n<p>相等时会先取右边的元素，排序结果的值是对的，但稳定性没了。改成 <code>&lt;=</code>，相等时优先取左边，左边的元素本来就在前面。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-4-链表\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-4-链表\\">#</a> 3.4 链表</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>三个变量：<code>pre</code>（已经反转好的那段的头）、<code>current</code>（正在处理的节点）、<code>next</code>（临时记住后继）</li>\\n<li>循环四步顺序固定：存 <code>next</code> → <code>current.next = pre</code> → <code>pre = current</code> → <code>current = next</code></li>\\n<li>必须先存 <code>next</code>：改完 <code>current.next</code>，原来的后半截就找不到了，这题唯一的坑</li>\\n<li><code>pre</code> 从 <code>null</code> 开始：原来的头会变成尾，尾要指向 <code>null</code></li>\\n<li>返回 <code>pre</code>，循环结束时 <code>current</code> 已经是 <code>null</code>；时间 <code>O(n)</code>、空间 <code>O(1)</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>反转链表就是把每个节点的箭头掉个头，用三个变量一边走一边改。</strong> 可以想象一排人手搭肩往前排，现在要让每个人转身搭后面那个人。关键是在改指针之前先用 <code>next</code> 记住下一个是谁，不然一转身就找不到后面的人了。<code>pre</code> 一开始是 <code>null</code>，因为原来的第一个节点反转后是最后一个；循环走完 <code>current</code> 是 <code>null</code>，新的头就是 <code>pre</code>。迭代写法只用三个变量，空间 <code>O(1)</code>，比递归稳。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>反转单向链表</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>该题目来自 LeetCode，题目需要将一个单向链表反转。思路很简单，使用三个变量分别表示当前节点和当前节点的前后节点，虽然这题很简单，但是却是一道面试常考题</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">reverseList</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">head</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 判断下变量边界问题</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>head <span class=\\"token operator\\">||</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>head<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>next<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> head\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 初始设置为空，因为第一个节点反转后就是尾部，尾部节点指向 null</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> pre <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">null</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> current <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> head\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> next\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 判断当前节点是否为空</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 不为空就先获取当前节点的下一节点</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 然后把当前节点的 next 设为上一个节点</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 然后把 current 设为下一个节点，pre 设为当前节点</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>current<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        next <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> current<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>next\\n        current<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>next <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> pre\\n        pre <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> current\\n        current <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> next\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> pre\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>有人写成 <code>current.next = pre; current = current.next</code>，三个节点跑完丢了后两个，为什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>第一句改完，<code>current.next</code> 已经指向 <code>pre</code> 了，第二句等于往回走，原来的后继再也拿不到。必须先 <code>const next = current.next</code> 存下来，再改指针，最后用 <code>next</code> 前进。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>空链表和只有一个节点的链表要特殊处理吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不用。<code>pre = null, current = head</code> 这套循环，<code>head</code> 为 <code>null</code> 时直接不进循环返回 <code>null</code>；单节点进一次循环，<code>next</code> 指向 <code>null</code> 就返回它自己。开头加一句 <code>if (!head || !head.next) return head</code> 只是提前返回，删了也对。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>几十万个节点的链表，用递归反转行不行？</strong></p>\\n<p>不推荐。递归每个节点占一层调用栈，<code>Chrome</code> 里默认栈深大约一万多层，几十万个节点肯定 <code>Maximum call stack size exceeded</code>。递归写法面试可以写出来展示理解，生产用迭代。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>反转之后遍历死循环了，最可能哪里写错了？</strong></p>\\n<p>八成是 <code>pre</code> 初始值不是 <code>null</code>，或者忘了改原头节点的 <code>next</code>，导致原头节点和第二个节点互相指着成环。调试时给遍历加个步数上限，别让诊断代码自己卡死；也要排除输入本来就有环，可以先用快慢指针检查。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>状态里要保留原链表做撤销，直接调用这个反转函数行吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不行，它是原地修改，跑完旧的 <code>head</code> 已经变成尾节点了。要保留原结构就边遍历边新建节点：<code>pre = { value: cur.value, next: pre }</code>，多花 <code>O(n)</code> 空间换不可变。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-5-树\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-5-树\\">#</a> 3.5 树</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>先序根左右、中序左根右、后序左右根：区别只是「什么时候访问根」</li>\\n<li>递归里每个节点会被路过三次（进来、左边回来、右边回来），在哪次输出就是哪种顺序</li>\\n<li>非递归用栈模拟：先序要先压右再压左，栈后进先出，左边才会先弹出</li>\\n<li>中序非递归：一路向左压到底，弹出时访问，再转去右子树；后序可以用两个栈，或者「根右左」反转</li>\\n<li><code>BST</code> 中序一定升序，拿来校验 <code>BST</code> 最省事；层序遍历用队列不是栈</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>三种遍历的区别只是访问根节点的时机：先序先访问根，中序在左右中间，后序最后。</strong> 递归写法里就是那行 <code>console.log</code> 放在两个递归调用的前面、中间还是后面。非递归是用栈手动模拟调用栈，先序要先压右孩子再压左孩子，因为栈是后进先出。实际场景里，先序适合复制一棵树或打印目录结构，后序适合先处理子节点再处理父节点，比如计算文件夹总大小、删除整棵树，中序主要用在 <code>BST</code> 上拿有序结果。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>二叉树的先序，中序，后序遍历</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>先序遍历表示先访问根节点，然后访问左节点，最后访问右节点。</li>\\n<li>中序遍历表示先访问左节点，然后访问根节点，最后访问右节点。</li>\\n<li>后序遍历表示先访问左节点，然后访问右节点，最后访问根节点</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>递归实现</strong></p>\\n<p>递归实现相当简单，代码如下</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">TreeNode</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">val</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>val <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> val<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">this</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">null</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">traversal</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">root</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 先序</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">traversal</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 中序</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// console.log(root);</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">traversal</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 后序</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// console.log(root);</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>对于递归的实现来说，只需要理解每个节点都会被访问三次就明白为什么这样实现了</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>非递归实现</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>非递归实现使用了栈的结构，通过栈的先进后出模拟递归实现。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p>以下是先序遍历代码实现</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">pre</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">root</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> stack <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 先将根节点 push</span>\\n    stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 判断栈中是否为空</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 弹出栈顶元素</span>\\n      root <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">pop</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 因为先序遍历是先左后右，栈是先进后出结构</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 所以先 push 右边再 push 左边</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>以下是中序遍历代码实现</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">mid</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">root</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> stack <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 中序遍历是先左再根最后右</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 所以首先应该先把最左边节点遍历到底依次 push 进栈</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 当左边没有节点时，就打印栈顶元素，然后寻找右节点</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 对于最左边的叶节点来说，可以把它看成是两个 null 节点的父节点</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 左边打印不出东西就把父节点拿出来打印，然后再看右节点</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">||</span> root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n        root <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        root <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">pop</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n        console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n        root <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>以下是后序遍历代码实现，该代码使用了两个栈来实现遍历，相比一个栈的遍历来说要容易理解很多</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">pos</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">root</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> stack1 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> stack2 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 后序遍历是先左再右最后根</span>\\n\\t<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 所以对于一个栈来说，应该先 push 根节点</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 然后 push 右节点，最后 push 左节点</span>\\n    stack1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>stack1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      root <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> stack1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">pop</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      stack2<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        stack1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        stack1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>stack2<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>s2<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">pop</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p><strong>中序遍历的前驱后继节点</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>实现这个算法的前提是节点有一个 <code>parent</code> 的指针指向父节点，根节点指向 <code>null</code></p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://user-gold-cdn.xitu.io/2018/4/24/162f61ad8e8588b7?w=682&amp;h=486&amp;f=png&amp;s=41027\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>如图所示，该树的中序遍历结果是 <code>4, 2, 5, 1, 6, 3, 7</code></p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><strong>前驱节点</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>对于节点 2 来说，他的前驱节点就是 4 ，按照中序遍历原则，可以得出以下结论</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<ul>\\n<li>如果选取的节点的左节点不为空，就找该左节点最右的节点。对于节点 1 来说，他有左节点 2 ，那么节点 2 的最右节点就是 5</li>\\n<li>如果左节点为空，且目标节点是父节点的右节点，那么前驱节点为父节点。对于节点 5 来说，没有左节点，且是节点 2 的右节点，所以节点 2 是前驱节点</li>\\n<li>如果左节点为空，且目标节点是父节点的左节点，向上寻找到第一个是父节点的右节点的节点。对于节点 6 来说，没有左节点，且是节点 3 的左节点，所以向上寻找到节点 1 ，发现节点 3 是节点 1 的右节点，所以节点 1 是节点 6 的前驱节点</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>以下是算法实现</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">predecessor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">node</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 结论 1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">getRight</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> parent <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>parent\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 结论 2 3 的判断</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>parent <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> parent<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right <span class=\\"token operator\\">===</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      node <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> parent\\n      parent <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>parent\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> parent\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">getRight</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">node</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span>\\n  node <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> node <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p><strong>后继节点</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>对于节点 2 来说，他的后继节点就是 5 ，按照中序遍历原则，可以得出以下结论</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<ul>\\n<li>如果有右节点，就找到该右节点的最左节点。对于节点 1 来说，他有右节点 3 ，那么节点 3 的最左节点就是 6</li>\\n<li>如果没有右节点，就向上遍历直到找到一个节点是父节点的左节点。对于节点 5 来说，没有右节点，就向上寻找到节点 2 ，该节点是父节点 1 的左节点，所以节点 1 是后继节点\\n以下是算法实现</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">successor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">node</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 结论 1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">getLeft</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 结论 2</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> parent <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>parent\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 判断 parent 为空</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>parent <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> parent<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left <span class=\\"token operator\\">===</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      node <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> parent\\n      parent <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>parent\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> parent\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">getLeft</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">node</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span>\\n  node <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> node <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> node<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> node\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p><strong>树的深度</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>树的最大深度：该题目来自 Leetcode，题目需要求出一颗二叉树的最大深度</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p>以下是算法实现</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">maxDepth</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">root</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">max</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token function\\">maxDepth</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">maxDepth</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>对于该递归函数可以这样理解：一旦没有找到节点就会返回 0，每弹出一次递归函数就会加一，树有三层就会得到3</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>先序遍历用栈实现，先压左再压右，结果为什么变成根右左？</strong></p>\\n<p>栈是后进先出，后压的右孩子先弹出来。想要根左右，就得反过来先压右、再压左。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>后序遍历非递归写起来最绕，有没有简单的办法？</strong></p>\\n<p>有个取巧写法：按「根、右、左」做一遍类似先序的遍历，结果反转就是「左、右、根」。</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">post</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">root</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> res <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> stack <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> root <span class=\\"token operator\\">?</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>root<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> n <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">pop</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>val<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>   <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 先压左，右边先弹出</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> stack<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">reverse</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>文档里的两个栈版本是同一个思路，第二个栈相当于这里的 <code>reverse</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>怎么判断一棵树是不是合法的 <code>BST</code>？</strong></p>\\n<p>中序遍历，检查是否严格递增，记一个 <code>prev</code> 边走边比就行，不用存数组。常见错误是只比较每个节点和它的直接孩子，像根 <code>10</code>、左孩子 <code>5</code>、<code>5</code> 的右孩子 <code>15</code> 这种就查不出来。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>后端返回的树可能退化成几千层，用递归求最大深度还能用吗？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>Math.max(depth(left), depth(right)) + 1</code> 写法很清晰，但深度太大时会撑爆调用栈。深度不可控就改成层序遍历，用队列一层层走，走了几层就是深度。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>评论树要展示「先父后子」的嵌套结构，用哪种遍历？</strong></p>\\n<p>先序。父评论先渲染，再递归渲染子评论，正好对应页面从上到下的顺序。如果要算每条评论底下一共多少条回复，就是后序，先把子树的数量算出来再加到父节点上。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n"}')}}]);